}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456","id":39686379,"login":"sbjang123456","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Njg2Mzc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commits/42ca04b2e8254b40f1a9df33130d35ad567eb7af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:14:18Z","email":"sbjang123456@gmail.com","name":"sbjang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:14:18Z","email":"sbjang123456@gmail.com","name":"sbjang"},"message":"이력서 기간 구분자를 엠대시에서 물결표로 바꿈\n\n회사·프로젝트·학력·병역 기간을 `2022-05-02 — 2023-08-10`처럼 엠대시로\n이어 적었는데, 날짜 사이에 긴 줄이 끼어 읽기에 거슬렸다. 노션 원본이 쓰고\n한국어 이력서에서 흔한 물결표로 바꿔 `2022-05-02 ~ 2023-08-10`으로 적는다.\n\n회사와 프로젝트 기간은 모두 formatPeriod를 거쳐 함수 하나만 고치면\n랜딩·전체보기·PDF가 함께 바뀐다. 학력·병역은 data.ts에 문자열로 적혀 있어\n따로 맞췄다. 임포터가 자른 기간을 찍는 로그와 data.test.ts의 기대값도\n같은 표기로 바꿨다. 페이지 제목 접미사 같은 다른 엠대시는 그대로다.\n\nlint·유닛 149건·빌드(PDF 포함) 통과. 빌드한 이력서 두 페이지에 날짜 사이\n엠대시가 남지 않은 것을 확인했다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8965124f045d5e02fae23173845c0325b2a3e8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/git/trees/8965124f045d5e02fae23173845c0325b2a3e8c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/git/commits/42ca04b2e8254b40f1a9df33130d35ad567eb7af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39686379?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456","id":39686379,"login":"sbjang123456","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Njg2Mzc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commit/42ca04b2e8254b40f1a9df33130d35ad567eb7af","node_id":"C_kwDOT0pg-NoAKDQyY2EwNGIyZTgyNTRiNDBmMWE5ZGYzMzEzMGQzNWFkNTY3ZWI3YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commit/35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9","sha":"35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commits/35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9"}],"sha":"42ca04b2e8254b40f1a9df33130d35ad567eb7af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commits/42ca04b2e8254b40f1a9df33130d35ad567eb7af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39686379?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456","id":39686379,"login":"sbjang123456","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Njg2Mzc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commits/35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:12:24Z","email":"sbjang123456@gmail.com","name":"sbjang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:12:24Z","email":"sbjang123456@gmail.com","name":"sbjang"},"message":"이력서 프로젝트 상세에 노션의 수행 기간을 실음\n\n노션 이력서의 프로젝트 목록은 데이터베이스라 페이지마다 기간 속성\n(daterange)이 있는데, 임포터가 본문 블록만 옮겨 사이트에는 프로젝트\n기간이 하나도 없었다. blocks.ts에 pagePeriod를 두어 페이지 속성에서\n날짜 어노테이션을 찾아 Project.period(from·to)로 옮긴다. 속성 키(nTgV)는\n스키마 id라 바뀔 수 있어 키에 기대지 않고 속성 전체를 훑는다.\n\n노션 날짜 중 두 건이 재직 기간 밖으로 나가 있었다. 쿠팡 모니터링은\n스토어링크 퇴사 뒤인 2024-08-30에 끝나고, 항공안전기술원 드론 실증도시는\n이노팸 입사 전인 2019-05-02에 시작한다. 이력서는 재직 기간을 기준으로\n보여 주므로 임포터가 clampPeriod로 회사 재직 기간 안에 자르고, 자른\n항목은 실행 로그에 원본과 함께 찍는다. 재직 중인 회사는 시작 쪽만 자른다.\n\n전체보기·PDF의 프로젝트 이름 옆에 회사와 같은 formatPeriod 형식으로\n기간을 붙였다. 좁은 화면에서는 이름 아래로 내려간다. 랜딩의 이름\n목록은 그대로다. 수기 상세(MDC 통합, AS포탈 React 전환)는 노션에 기간이\n없어 period를 비워 두고 표시하지 않는다.\n\n생성물은 --no-images로 다시 만들어 period 필드만 늘었다. 테스트는\n기간 읽기·자르기, 모든 기간이 형식에 맞고 재직 기간 안에 있는지, 노션\n상세에 기간이 빠짐없는지를 본다.\n\nlint·유닛 149건·e2e 26건·import:notion:check 통과. 전체보기를 넓은\n화면과 400px에서 스크린샷으로 확인했다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b73edf9880b8fb4d01e359b436608f945940e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/git/trees/7b73edf9880b8fb4d01e359b436608f945940e54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/git/commits/35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39686379?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456","id":39686379,"login":"sbjang123456","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Njg2Mzc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbjang123456","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commit/35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9","node_id":"C_kwDOT0pg-NoAKDM1ZjEyZWY5NzgxZmMyMTJiNTBkM2I4ZDQ0YjU4YjU5YzgyZTg0Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commit/a6a616b00fc19f24b8dd77e32b820173d2bc975e","sha":"a6a616b00fc19f24b8dd77e32b820173d2bc975e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commits/a6a616b00fc19f24b8dd77e32b820173d2bc975e"}],"sha":"35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sbjang123456/sbjang123456.github.io/commits/35f12ef9781fc212b50d3b8d44b58b59c82e84f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39686379?v=4","eve