ull,"html_url":"https://github.com/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/commit/16fec2a2fa44cb2950ff38a2ec09d45a65504983","node_id":"C_kwDOT0uWDdoAKDE2ZmVjMmEyZmE0NGNiMjk1MGZmMzhhMmVjMDlkNDVhNjU1MDQ5ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/commit/0a4b35c241a0777b76a5c9cb317bf9d6aebda272","sha":"0a4b35c241a0777b76a5c9cb317bf9d6aebda272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/commits/0a4b35c241a0777b76a5c9cb317bf9d6aebda272"}],"sha":"16fec2a2fa44cb2950ff38a2ec09d45a65504983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/commits/16fec2a2fa44cb2950ff38a2ec09d45a65504983"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/commits/0a4b35c241a0777b76a5c9cb317bf9d6aebda272/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T00:31:26Z","email":"afkmoney@github.com","name":"AFKmoney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T00:31:26Z","email":"afkmoney@github.com","name":"AFKmoney"},"message":"feat: Fractus CTE v2.0 — clean isolated release\n\n12 building blocks connected:\n- Continuous Thought Engine (multi-block, continuous thought)\n- Persistent Memory (salience-gated, cross-session)\n- Cognitive Modes (unsupervised k-means)\n- RAG (KnowledgeBase + Plugins + MetaCognition)\n- Progressive Growth (width + depth + experts + rank)\n- Self-Modification (runtime expert growth)\n- PhaseRoutedMoE (sparse, low-rank, differentiable)\n- Online Trainer (SGD/AdamW, accumulation, chunk=32)\n- HF Space (agent frontend)\n- 28 tests, white paper v2.0, arXiv source, optimization docs\n\nAuthor: Philippe-Antoine Robert (rpa.tu@proton.me)","tree":{"sha":"1442be30fa838b57bdc9b3efcc686a74894c29b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/git/trees/1442be30fa838b57bdc9b3efcc686a74894c29b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AFKmoney/fractus-cte/git/commits/0a4b35c241a0777b76a5c9cb317bf9d6aebda272","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}}