","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wtthornton","id":52006304,"login":"wtthornton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDA2MzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wtthornton/agentforge-federation-plugin/commits/558c0609973b203b5885e5ffb326ea78b8bc5c0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T21:01:57Z","email":"tapp.thornton@gmail.com","name":"Bill Thornton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T21:01:57Z","email":"tapp.thornton@gmail.com","name":"Bill Thornton"},"message":"chore: track uv.lock so the rig resolves reproducibly\n\nThe rig declares real runtime deps (fastapi, pydantic) but shipped no lockfile,\nso every checkout re-resolved and the file sat permanently untracked in\n`git status`. AgentForge tracks its own uv.lock; match that.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QXGi2BkvoDAKNC6XBYn1Yh","tree":{"sha":"ebf1f86da9d1cc4ecc3c11e73202bf1f75c6e016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wtthornton/agentforge-federation-plugin/git/trees/ebf1f86da9d1cc4ecc3c11e73202bf1f75c6e016"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wtthornton/agentforge-federation-plugin/git/commits/558c0609973b203b5885e5ffb326ea78b8bc5