m/users/chenxuyaun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun","id":38125955,"login":"chenxuyaun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTI1OTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/8500ba8b93bca28f308f8de4724f03161deb6d72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:07:01Z","email":"38125955+chenxuyaun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chenxuyaun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:07:01Z","email":"38125955+chenxuyaun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chenxuyaun"},"message":"refactor(v11): 全站深度重构收尾 — 藏馆/宇宙/次级页纸卡化，玻璃拟态退场\n\n- 角色宇宙：对话场气泡纸卡（AI=纸卡/用户=青瓷描边）、字形按钮→lucide、空态邀请化\n- 作品库/提示词库：作品墙与画廊为记忆点；玻璃浮层系统清除；收藏误用 danger → 青瓷\n- 知识库/ASMR/素材库：纸卡 + 呼吸节奏 + tabular-nums；R18 徽标去朱砂\n- 灵感画廊/分享墙/Agent库/成长/团队：ai-glass（跨页无效类）→ 正规纸卡\n- 共享 Card 组件升级 v11 纸卡形制（连带 Dashboard/PromptGen/Photography/Tasks 等页自动生效）\n- 签名 URL 过期自愈推广到全部媒体页（refreshAssetUrl onError 单次刷新）\n- 页面入场动画禁用（动效纪律 §五：无入场序列）\n- 全站终扫：杂色 0 / transition-all 0 / ai-glass(非hub) 0","tree":{"sha":"9a041e7b1b4b19f0db720ab17952fb89ce2d39c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/git/trees/9a041e7b1b4b19f0db720ab17952fb89ce2d39c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/git/commits/8500ba8b93bca28f308f8de4724f03161deb6d72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu