henxuyaun/aigc-studio/commit/454dfe0e6958435a3e43e12fce34e2a3ee84ebc8","node_id":"C_kwDOT0xEq9oAKDQ1NGRmZTBlNjk1ODQzNWEzZTQzZTEyZmNlMzRlMmEzZWU4NGViYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commit/b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a","sha":"b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a"}],"sha":"454dfe0e6958435a3e43e12fce34e2a3ee84ebc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/454dfe0e6958435a3e43e12fce34e2a3ee84ebc8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38125955?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun","id":38125955,"login":"chenxuyaun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTI1OTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:50:41Z","email":"38125955+chenxuyaun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chenxuyaun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:50:41Z","email":"38125955+chenxuyaun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chenxuyaun"},"message":"saiOS 批10：Agent 团队协作——目标→规划分工→成员接力→最终交付报告\n\n- team_runs 表（迁移 d4e6f8a0c2b4）：goal/status(planning|running|done|failed)/\n  members(规划 JSON)/steps(每步即时落库供前端轮询)/final_report\n- team_service：规划（LLM 出 3-4 人分工 JSON）→ 成员串行接力（后者可见前序\n  产出）→ 队长汇总交付报告；后台自开 AsyncSessionLocal；失败如实落库不外抛\n- 🔴 三个实战坑：\n  ① MySQL TEXT 列不能 server_default（建表失败 api 循环重启，默认值走 ORM 层）\n  ② gpt-oss 推理模型 reasoning 先吃 token：max_tokens 压小=content 恒空，\n     团队场景不限制（后台任务慢点无妨）\n  ③ cpa 偶发「200 但空 body」假响应——openai_compatible._post_retry 补\n     空 200 重试，救回团队/反思等长链路\n- API：POST /teams/start、GET /teams/{id}、GET /teams（列表）\n- 前端 /team：目标输入→成员 chips（✓ 已完成态）→步骤卡实时出现→📦最终报告；\n  3s 轮询 + 最近协作历史回看；导航挂「自动化」组\n- pytest test_teams 4 用例绿；公网 E2E 两段式：浏览器 6/6（启动/规划/步骤卡）\n  + 后台轮询至 done 实证真实交付（咖啡馆开业宣传终稿含品牌规范表）","tree":{"sha":"ccc4b9da60579aa0ebee65e722010986932619d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/git/trees/ccc4b9da60579aa0ebee65e722010986932619d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/git/commits/b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38125955?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun","id":38125955,"login":"chenxuyaun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTI1OTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commit/b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a","node_id":"C_kwDOT0xEq9oAKGIzNjZkODk1MDMzZTA3NGQxODI5YmI0MjFiMmMzMmFlMTFjNTBlMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commit/93e370a6c27df8b4eab21f671a3a07bf295a26ef","sha":"93e370a6c27df8b4eab21f671a3a07bf295a26ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/93e370a6c27df8b4eab21f671a3a07bf295a26ef"}],"sha":"b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/b366d895033e074d1829bb421b2c32ae11c50e1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38125955?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun","id":38125955,"login":"chenxuyaun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTI1OTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/commits/93e370a6c27df8b4eab21f671a3a07bf295a26ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:22:18Z","email":"38125955+chenxuyaun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chenxuyaun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:22:18Z","email":"38125955+chenxuyaun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chenxuyaun"},"message":"saiOS 批8+9：AI 生命体成长日记 + 调度大厅长期记忆（AI 开始记得你）\n\n- 模型：ai_growth_diary（会话反思日记：摘要/教训/亮点）+\n  ai_memory_entries（对用户的长期记忆：偏好/背景/事件/情绪，去重+60 条上限淘汰）\n  迁移 c3d5e7f9a1b2（down=b1c2d3e4f5a6 单头核实）\n- growth_service.reflect_session：取会话最近 14 条消息交 LLM 提炼 JSON，\n  写日记 + 过滤非法 kind 后存记忆；节流（新增 <4 条消息不重复反思）；\n  LLM 失败静默降级绝不拖垮主链路；后台任务自开 AsyncSessionLocal 短会话\n- agent_chat_stream 加 user_id：system prompt 注入「AI 记得你的信息」\n  （≤900 字符预算），新对话自动带上用户偏好——跨会话不失忆\n- /generations/text/agent/chat 流正常结束后 asyncio.create_task 后台反思；\n  AgentChatRequest 加 session_id（前端 currentId 随请求上行）\n- API：GET /growth/diary（envelope 分页）、GET /growth/memories、\n  POST /growth/memories/delete、POST /growth/reflect（手动）/reflect-bg\n- 前端：/growth 成长足迹页（🧠AI记得的你记忆 chips 可删除 + 📔日记时间线\n  加载更多）；AppShell 系统组入口；调度大厅 send() 带 session_id\n- 坑记录：①nginx SPA 白名单正则需加 growth（否则直接访问 404）\n  ②apiClient 路径勿带 /api/v1 前缀（baseUrl 已含→双前缀 404）\n  ③saiOS basename=/saios，E2E 直访须打 /saios/growth\n- pytest 新增 test_growth 7 用例全绿；公网 E2E 7/7（两轮对话→30s 后\n  /growth 见 15 条记忆 chips + 4 篇日记），jsErrors 空","tree":{"sha":"94d437966ad38c95e687bf0cacdcff7ae3da4726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/git/trees/94d437966ad38c95e687bf0cacdcff7ae3da4726"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chenxuyaun/aigc-studio/git/commits/93e370a6c27df8b4eab21f671a3a07bf295a26ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38125955?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenxuyaun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chenxuyaun","id":38125955,"login":"chenxuyaun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTI1OTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.