epos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/0f630a0fea397e0faa9dac7fc801642ccc751f7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:26:01Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:26:01Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"fix: output standalone rompia el build en Vercel (ENOENT next-server.js.nft.json)\n\noutput:''standalone'' es solo para el Dockerfile local; en Vercel choca con su propio\nfile tracing y tumbaba el build (los ultimos 4 deploys fallaron, incluido el fix del\nbuscador de empleo). Ahora solo se activa con DOCKER_BUILD=1.\n\nDe paso, hace idempotente la migracion 0005_cv_uploads.sql (drop policy if exists\nantes de cada create policy) para que se pueda re-correr sin el error 42710 si una\ncorrida anterior quedo a medias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c81a163d8e820800de86983989b8c0bd9f4f6335","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/c81a163d8e820800de86983989b8c0bd9f4f6335"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/0f630a0fea397e0faa9dac7fc801642ccc751f7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gi