pi.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/a073d955782010e98a43aebd0f7aff7fababaf2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:25:18Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:25:18Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"fix: el buscador no encontraba ofertas para carreras reales\n\nCausa real: bestScrapedTerm() solo hacia match de texto literal\n(\"substring\") contra los 12 terminos curados que scrapea el cron.\nCarreras reales como \"Ingenieria en Tecnologias de la Informacion\" no\ncomparten texto literal con ningun termino (\"ingeniero de software\",\n\"analista de sistemas\", etc.) y devolvia cero resultados en silencio,\naunque ya habia cientos de ofertas reales guardadas en cache.\n\nAdemas, incluso apuntando al termino correcto por raiz de palabra\n(\"ingeniero\" ~ \"ingenieria\"), ese termino especifico podia tener solo\nofertas viejas cacheadas ese dia (fuera de la ventana de 7 dias)\nmientras que otro termino relacionado (\"desarrollador\") si tenia\ndatos frescos -- apostar a un unico \"mejor\" termino perdia esos\nresultados.\n\nFix: matchScrapedTerms() ahora devuelve TODOS los terminos plausibles\n(substring + raiz de palabra compartida + un mapa de pistas curado\npara casos sin raiz literal comun) y se combinan los resultados de\ntodos antes del filtro de frescura, en vez de apostar a uno solo.\n\nVerificado en vivo: \"Ingenieria en Tecnologias de la Informacion\" (el\ncaso real reportado) paso de 0 a 4 ofertas frescas reales; \"Ingenieria\nen Sistemas\" -> 10. Limpie tambien las entradas de cache vacias que\nhabian quedado guardadas por una hora con el bug anterior.\n\nnpm test (6/6) y build de produccion sin errores.","tree":{"sha":"56689e0e371200877b43534ce7793647839ee6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/56689e0e371200877b43534ce7793647839ee6f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/a073d955782010e98a43aebd0f7aff7fababaf2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/a073d955782010e98a43aebd0f7aff7fababaf2d","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKGEwNzNkOTU1NzgyMDEwZTk4YTQzYWViZDBmN2FmZjdmYWJhYmFmMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233","sha":"711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233"}],"sha":"a073d955782010e98a43aebd0f7aff7fababaf2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/a073d955782010e98a43aebd0f7aff7fababaf2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:03:49Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:03:49Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"feat: guardar CV en el Buscador de Empleo (opt-in, requiere login)\n\n- Migracion 0005_cv_uploads.sql: bucket privado de Supabase Storage\n  (cv-uploads, 8MB, solo PDF) + tabla cv_uploads con RLS por\n  auth.uid() -- mismo patron ya probado en miembros. El PDF se sube\n  directo desde el navegador del usuario logueado a Storage, sin pasar\n  por el servidor.\n- pages/proyectos/buscador-empleo.js: cliente de Supabase en el\n  navegador (mismo flujo que public/index.html: public-config ->\n  createClient), deteccion de sesion y de CV ya guardado. Tras\n  analizar un CV, si hay sesion aparece un boton opt-in \"Guardar mi\n  CV\" con su propio checkbox de consentimiento -- nada se guarda sin\n  eso. Si ya existe un CV guardado, la tarjeta ofrece usarlo, subir\n  otro o eliminarlo. Sin login, el flujo de analisis sigue exactamente\n  igual que antes (transitorio, sin guardar nada) -- sin regresion.\n- privacidad.html: documenta el nuevo camino opt-in (Storage privado,\n  solo el dueño puede verlo, borrado con un clic como derecho de\n  supresion), y suma Facebook a los proveedores OAuth ya mencionados.\n- README/CLAUDE.md al dia con la nueva migracion y el flujo.\n\nVerificado: npm test (6/6), build de produccion limpio, flujo completo\nde analisis sin login probado en vivo con un PDF real (extrae texto,\nllama a la IA, pre-llena busqueda, muestra el aviso correcto de\n\"inicia sesion para guardar\" cuando no hay sesion) -- sin regresion.\nEl flujo de guardar/usar/eliminar con sesion real no se pudo probar\nen este entorno (requiere un login OAuth real), queda para que el\nusuario lo confirme con su propia cuenta tras correr la migracion.\n\nPendiente manual: aplicar supabase/migrations/0005_cv_uploads.sql en\nel SQL Editor de Supabase.","tree":{"sha":"b8d281578e504faa6e26e8e8e89034957fbf31d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/b8d281578e504faa6e26e8e8e89034957fbf31d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKDcxMWM0ZjcxYzY0ZWQ4OWQ5NzJiYmFhYmUzMmY4OGU0MWJhMzQyMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6","sha":"e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6"}],"sha":"711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/711c4f71c64ed89d972bbaabe32f88e41ba34233"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:52:16Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:52:16Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"fix: contraste real de .btn y menos solicitudes en cadena de Supabase\n\n- .btn nunca declaraba background -- el navegador usaba su gris claro\n  por defecto (buttonface) detras de texto casi blanco, invisible.\n  Encontrado por el propio reporte de Lighthouse del usuario (botón\n  \"Entendido\" del aviso de privacidad). Ahora background:transparent\n  explicito; los botones que sí llevan color (btn-primary, btn-whatsapp)\n  siguen igual porque su regla va despues en el CSS.\n- Import de @supabase/supabase-js via esm.sh ahora usa ?bundle: pasa de\n  ~17 solicitudes en cadena (auth-js, postgrest-js, realtime-js,\n  storage-js, functions-js, tslib, phoenix, iceberg-js... cada uno por\n  separado) a 7, verificado con performance.getEntriesByType en el\n  navegador. Reduce directamente la ruta crítica que señalaba el\n  reporte de Lighthouse, sin tocar nada de la arquitectura del sitio.\n\nVerificado: npm test (6/6), consola sin errores, login social sigue\ninicializando bien (account-area muestra \"unirse\" correctamente).","tree":{"sha":"96f3f69b3f32c2f8411ba9fa7d0ef864b0a761ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/96f3f69b3f32c2f8411ba9fa7d0ef864b0a761ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKGUwNGFhODYyYzlhMzFmMDMzYzZjZWM2NjMyZTM5ZGRlMzg5YjUyZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/99cd63fd2eebd11a1917170d3b2a76f6dc103550","sha":"99cd63fd2eebd11a1917170d3b2a76f6dc103550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/99cd63fd2eebd11a1917170d3b2a76f6dc103550"}],"sha":"e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/e04aa862c9a31f033c6cec6632e39dde389b52d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/99cd63fd2eebd11a1917170d3b2a76f6dc103550/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:32:18Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:32:18Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"feat: backend mas profesional (rate limiting real, Sentry, Docker, docs)\n\n- Rate limiting real: lib/rateLimit.js respaldado en Supabase (funcion\n  atomica increment_rate_limit, migracion 0004_rate_limits.sql), con\n  fallback en memoria si Supabase no esta configurado. Reemplaza los\n  Map en memoria duplicados en chat.js, join.js y lib/jobs/rateLimit.js\n  (ese archivo se elimina). Cada endpoint usa su propio scope para no\n  compartir cupo entre si.\n- Monitoreo de errores con Sentry (@sentry/nextjs), opt-in via\n  SENTRY_DSN / NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN -- sin esas variables no hace\n  nada, no rompe el build.\n- Docker para desarrollo local portable (Dockerfile multi-stage,\n  docker-compose.yml, next.config.js con output: ''standalone'').\n  Producción real sigue en Vercel sin cambios. Build y arranque del\n  contenedor verificados en vivo.\n- README/CLAUDE.md al dia: las 5 tablas de Supabase ya estan aplicadas\n  en el proyecto real (antes decia \"en desarrollo\"), documentadas las\n  nuevas env vars y el flujo de Docker.\n\nVerificado: npm test (6/6), build de produccion, docker build + run\nsirviendo el sitio real, rate limiter bloqueando en el limite exacto\ncon fallback en memoria funcionando, /api/chat end-to-end.\n\nPendiente manual: aplicar supabase/migrations/0004_rate_limits.sql en\nel SQL Editor de Supabase (mismo flujo de siempre).","tree":{"sha":"c8a73d692044a3f4cd3ada5a72409952efad3694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/c8a73d692044a3f4cd3ada5a72409952efad3694"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/99cd63fd2eebd11a1917170d3b2a76f6dc103550","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","receiv