Ingenier-a/commits/0c83eb2f5763c2532b47c9e3a590bfd268d32655/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T02:54:36Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T02:54:36Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"chore: limpia archivos internos de Claude Code subidos por error\n\nSe subieron por accidente 3 archivos que son herramienta interna de\nClaude Code (la skill \"skill-creator\" de Anthropic, guardada dos veces\ncon nombres en espanol sin relacion a su contenido real), mas un\narchivo de definicion de skill suelto. Ninguno es parte del proyecto:\n\n- Habilidad.md (eliminado)\n- \"requisitos funcionales del club de la ingenieria.md\" (eliminado --\n  mismo contenido que Habilidad.md)\n- \"SKILL (1).md\" (eliminado)\n\nAdemas, se reorganizan los dos documentos de requisitos reales\n(escritos por el equipo, no de Claude) a docs/ con nombres mas claros:\n- economia-virtual-laboratorio-b-requisitos-y-prompt.md\n  -> docs/requisitos-economia-virtual.md\n- mega-prompt-buscador-empleo.md\n  -> docs/requisitos-buscador-empleo.md","tree":{"sha":"55ad1c4c685133a0b1975a512ddec64158d0b578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/55ad1c4c685133a0b1975a512ddec64158d0b578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/0c83eb2f5763c2532b47c9e3a590bfd268d32655","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: