ez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/117fab106a66df1d54c997b14ca803cfe0747932/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T02:04:40Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T02:04:40Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"docs: actualiza el README con la economia ByteCoin y el CV con IA\n\n- Nuevas tarjetas de caracteristicas: economia virtual ByteCoin y\n  analisis de CV con IA en el Buscador de Empleo.\n- Seccion del Buscador de Empleo: explica el flujo de analisis de CV\n  (extraccion en el navegador con pdf.js, cascada de IA compartida).\n- Estructura del repositorio actualizada: lib/ai/, lib/jobs/,\n  pages/api/jobs/, pages/api/cron/, pages/proyectos/, vercel.json,\n  migracion 0003.\n- Stack tecnologico: agrega pdf.js y Cheerio; corrige la fila de IA\n  para reflejar los 3 proveedores en cascada.\n- Roadmap: nueva fila para Buscador de Empleo (completado).\n- Quita JOB_SCRAPER_CRON_HOURS del ejemplo de .env (no usada por el\n  codigo, ya documentado asi en la tabla de variables).","tree":{"sha":"4383494a96040fb01686f242f92a2ec0d8d0513e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/4383494a96040fb01686f242f92a2ec0d8d0513e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/117fab106a66df1d54c997b14ca803cfe0747932","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/117fab106a66df1d54c997b14ca803cfe0747932","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKDExN2ZhYjEwNmE2NmRmMWQ1NGM5OTdiMTRjYTgwM2NmZTA3NDc5MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/55f43fd54d03e1faa2cf47012f6602d6cbe11c29","sha":"55f43fd54d03e1faa2cf47012f6602d6cbe11c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/55f43fd54d03e1faa2cf47012f6602d6cbe11c29"}],"sha":"117fab106a66df1d54c997b14ca803cfe0747932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/117fab106a66df1d54c997b14ca803cfe0747932"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/55f43fd54d03e1faa2cf47012f6602d6cbe11c29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:48:20Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:48:20Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Buscador de Empleo: analisis de CV con IA + matching de ofertas\n\n- lib/ai/complete.js (nuevo): extrae la cascada compartida Groq->\n  OpenRouter->NVIDIA con cuota diaria, antes vivia solo dentro de\n  pages/api/chat.js. Ahora la reutiliza tambien el analizador de CV,\n  sin duplicar esa logica.\n- pages/api/chat.js: usa el helper nuevo, mismo comportamiento de\n  antes (probado en vivo, responde igual).\n- pages/api/jobs/analyze-cv.js (nuevo): recibe el texto ya extraido\n  de un CV (nunca el PDF en si), le pide a la IA un JSON estructurado\n  (carrera/experiencia/tipoEmpleo/habilidadesClave/resumenPerfil) con\n  los mismos enums que ya usa el formulario de busqueda, parseo\n  defensivo si la IA envuelve el JSON en markdown, mismo rate-limit\n  por IP que /api/jobs/search.\n- pages/proyectos/buscador-empleo.js: nueva tarjeta \"Subir mi CV\" --\n  extraccion de texto en el navegador con pdfjs-dist (el PDF nunca\n  sale del navegador, solo el texto), llama a analyze-cv, pre-llena\n  el formulario existente y dispara la busqueda automaticamente.\n  Tarjetas de resultado con chip \"Coincide en: ...\" y reordenadas por\n  cantidad de coincidencias cuando hay un perfil de CV activo.\n- public/privacidad.html: nueva finalidad de tratamiento (analisis\n  transitorio de CV, sin almacenamiento) y los 3 proveedores de IA\n  listados en la tabla de transferencias internacionales.\n- package.json: nueva dependencia pdfjs-dist.\n\nProbado en vivo de punta a punta: extraccion real de un PDF de\nprueba en el navegador, analisis de IA correcto, formulario\npre-llenado, busqueda automatica disparada, chips de habilidades\nmostrados. Chat de INGenioso verificado sin regresion tras el\nrefactor de lib/ai/complete.js.","tree":{"sha":"80be39c310ced7cf95384e588ea063f92247f34a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/80be39c310ced7cf95384e588ea063f92247f34a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/55f43fd54d03e1faa2cf47012f6602d6cbe11c29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"