":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:32:31Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:32:31Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Corrige espacio en blanco enorme y enlace de LinkedIn en Buscador de Empleo\n\n- El espacio gigante arriba (habia que hacer scroll para ver el\n  dashboard) lo causaba una regla propia (.page > *{position:relative})\n  que sin querer le ganaba en cascada a .bg-glow{position:fixed} --\n  los circulos decorativos de fondo dejaban de ser flotantes y\n  ocupaban ~450px de espacio real en el documento. Se excluye .bg-glow\n  de esa regla (.page > *:not(.bg-glow)).\n- La tarjeta de JuniorJobs enlazaba al LinkedIn del creador del\n  boletin; ahora enlaza al LinkedIn del club (donde se comparte la\n  publicacion semanal), con el texto del boton actualizado.","tree":{"sha":"8bfd59b0fff4bd50839ac79a449e3c7b4f75c0de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/8bfd59b0fff4bd50839ac79a449e3c7b4f75c0de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/8ca8406ccbdec393cb075fc027b486467d2d0aff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","