nPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/1aeffad238d95fe5ff9076db7038c00545bd9023/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:16:24Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:16:24Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"SEO: sitemap actualizado, meta tags y datos estructurados del club\n\n- sitemap.xml: agrega el juego (/linux-cli.html) y el buscador de\n  empleo (/proyectos/buscador-empleo), que faltaban; actualiza lastmod.\n  robots.txt ya estaba correcto, sin cambios.\n- index.html: agrega meta keywords, og:url, og:locale y Twitter Card\n  (title/description/image ya existian via Open Graph, esto los\n  complementa para mas plataformas).\n- Agrega JSON-LD (schema.org EducationalOrganization) con nombre,\n  alternateName, logo, descripcion y sameAs (Facebook + GitHub del\n  club) -- le da a Google una señal explicita y estructurada de que\n  \"El Club de la Ingeniería\" es el nombre de esta entidad, mas fuerte\n  para busquedas de marca que solo el <title>/description.","tree":{"sha":"cbcf73d4c5ac177cdfc83e6002b2208f4b2f7e44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/cbcf73d4c5ac177cdfc83e6002b2208f4b2f7e44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/1aeffad238d95fe5ff9076db7038c00545bd9023","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/1aeffad238d95fe5ff9076db7038c00545bd9023","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKDFhZWZmYWQyMzhkOTVmZTVmZjkwNzZkYjcwMzhjMDA1NDViZDkwMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b","sha":"bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b"}],"sha":"1aeffad238d95fe5ff9076db7038c00545bd9023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/1aeffad238d95fe5ff9076db7038c00545bd9023"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:13:48Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:13:48Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Sitio: navegacion sin cortes, tarjeta destacada para empleo, beca retroactiva\n\npublic/index.html:\n- Corrige el scroll de anclas del nav (#about, #projects, #team, #media,\n  #eventos, #join): el header fixed (~66px) tapaba el inicio de cada\n  seccion al saltar. Se agrega scroll-margin-top:88px a las secciones,\n  verificado en vivo (0 solapamiento en las 6 anclas, desktop/tablet/movil).\n- Buscador de Empleo pasa de proj-card pequena a tarjeta destacada\n  (.job-featured) del mismo tamano/estructura que la del juego\n  (.proj-featured): mismo padding, ancho, corner-brackets, grid 1.2fr/.8fr,\n  con icono SVG propio y acento teal/oro en vez de verde.\n- proj-grid reordenada: los 2 proyectos reales (\"En produccion\") ahora\n  van primero, los 4 aun no implementados quedan despues -- de paso pasa\n  de 7 a 6 tarjetas, grilla 3x2 simetrica en vez de una fila con 1 sola\n  tarjeta huerfana.\n\npublic/linux-cli.html:\n- La beca inicial de 1.000.000 BC (agregada en el commit anterior) no\n  llegaba a partidas que ya tenian un objeto \"economy\" guardado de antes\n  del fix (ej. jugadores durante el periodo que Vercel no desplegaba) --\n  se quedaban en bytecoin:0 para siempre. Se agrega una migracion\n  retroactiva de una sola vez (flag becaInicialOtorgada) que corre en\n  CUALQUIER partida cargada sin la beca ya otorgada, sin importar si es\n  nueva o vieja. Probado en vivo simulando un save afectado: recibe el\n  millon correctamente y no se duplica en recargas siguientes.","tree":{"sha":"926cd09c51f32e13a9ea421562c71359a8525956","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/926cd09c51f32e13a9ea421562c71359a8525956"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKGJjMTI1Yjk4MTQzZDM1NGU5ZTZhNWVjMDkyZGE4MjQxMmU1NmMyMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/2c3a505933ced2dd2b43da3f0af32fce21ead157","sha":"2c3a505933ced2dd2b43da3f0af32fce21ead157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/2c3a505933ced2dd2b43da3f0af32fce21ead157"}],"sha":"bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/bc125b98143d354e9e6a5ec092da82412e56c21b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/2c3a505933ced2dd2b43da3f0af32fce21ead157/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:52:05Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:52:05Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Corrige vercel.json: el cron cada 6h rompia el deploy en el plan Hobby\n\nEl plan gratuito de Vercel solo permite 1 ejecucion diaria por cron job;\n\"0 */6 * * *\" (4 veces al dia) hace que Vercel rechace el despliegue\ncompleto del proyecto -- coincide exactamente con el commit donde\nempezaron a fallar los checks (8a3da0f, el que agrego este vercel.json)\ny con que produccion quedo congelada desde ahi. Cambiado a \"0 6 * * *\"\n(1 vez al dia), dentro del limite del plan gratuito.","tree":{"sha":"cdda59dfe9b8484603c5a05036c181f65b0ad645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/cdda59dfe9b8484603c5a05036c181f65b0ad645"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/2c3a505933ced2dd2b43da3f0af32fce21ead157","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/2c3a505933ced2dd2b43da3f0af32fce21ead157","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKDJjM2E1MDU5MzNjZWQyZGQyYjQzZGEzZjBhZjMyZmNlMjFlYWQxNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/fd4a123fe5dda61b388a47856165ae0d7cc