NVIDIA) ya no estan disponibles (404 confirmado\n  contra las APIs reales, no falta de cuota). Reemplazados por\n  openai/gpt-oss-20b (con reasoning_effort:\"low\", si no gasta el budget\n  de tokens \"pensando\" y devuelve vacio) y meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct\n  respectivamente. Probado en vivo end-to-end, responde correctamente.\n- linux-cli.html: el boton de voz de INGenioso usaba el mismo par de\n  iconos 🔊/🔇 que el boton de sonido ambiente, pareciendo un boton\n  duplicado. Ahora usa 🗣️/🤐, visualmente distinto.","tree":{"sha":"c35718b83d5048e1c6eab2eaf67b1c0a95bfe4ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/c35718b83d5048e1c6eab2eaf67b1c0a95bfe4ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/db21d9267fed9ed9e5dd14606da42d941009e4fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPere