@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Juego: beca inicial de 1.000.000 BC + reescalado de precios + sonido de monedas\n\n- Partida nueva arranca con 1.000.000 BC (beca del laboratorio), pero el\n  arbol de mejoras y las recompensas por nivel se reescalan x200 para que\n  esa beca no alcance para comprar todo de una — el arbol completo cuesta\n  ~1.995.000 BC, asi que sigue haciendo falta jugar y ganar mas.\n  bytecoinLifetime arranca en 0 (solo cuenta lo ganado jugando, no la beca).\n  El reset de economia (panel admin) tambien restaura la misma beca inicial.\n- Formato legible fmtBC() con separador de miles en todos los montos\n  mostrados (billetera, tienda, historial, mensajes de INGenioso).\n- Nuevo sonido sintetizado de \"moneda\" (Web Audio) al ganar BC\n  (playCoinEarnSound, tono ascendente) y al gastar BC en la tienda\n  (playCoinSpendSound, tono descendente), enganchados en\n  awardBytecoin()/spendBytecoin().","tree":{"sha":"9d8e05bffd3be5d8c9df3ed1b1088ce37367884e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/9d8e05bffd3be5d8c9df3ed1b1088ce37367884e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/311ce0569630d00c156a9c3bd43ecd6f38ccbc82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com