vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/487d1556a45ad8c5bc4136c9f0c77d44545cc41b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:45:10Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:45:10Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Juego: guion narrativo completo de las 248 etapas (31 niveles x 8)\n\n- docs/narrativa-dialogos-completos.md: diseno completo del guion, con\n  plantilla de tono por rango y las 248 entradas (transicion + teoria\n  aplicada + instruccion), adaptadas de docs/teoria-operacion-laboratorio-b.md\n  y verificadas contra los triggers reales de cada handleLevelN.\n- STAGE_DIALOGUE en linux-cli.html: estructura de datos con las 248\n  entradas, conectada a announceNext()/startTerminal()/refreshInstrFloat()\n  — cada etapa acertada (incluida la primera de cada nivel) abre ahora\n  la ventana grande de INGenioso con el dialogo especifico escrito para\n  ese comando, no un halago generico. Con fallback seguro al\n  comportamiento anterior si alguna entrada faltara.","tree":{"sha":"082ac744fd9532a296634d718974c92c4b9c8b6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/082ac744fd9532a296634d718974c92c4b9c8b6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/487d1556a45ad8c5bc4136c9f0c77d44545cc41b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1843