sts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/251cbc0ac09d99124ed3aa33ceb03a2de2c3a873/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:59:56Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:59:56Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Juego: ventana de instrucciones unificada + fixes de layout y centrado\n\n- Cada paso acertado (8x31 niveles) abre la misma ventana grande y\n  bloqueante que el brief de nivel, en vez de solo actualizar la burbuja\n  de chat; \"Entendido\" la minimiza a un icono flotante fijo (#instr-float,\n  mismo patron que el chatbot del sitio) que la vuelve a abrir sin\n  reescribir el texto.\n- fitGameStage(): ajuste dinamico en JS del ancho de la torre retro para\n  que quepa completa (chasis + base) sin recortarse ni forzar scroll,\n  reemplazando una formula CSS que no era confiable entre viewports.\n  Corrige ademas un squish oculto por flex-stretch en .game-hud-frame.\n  vale\n- Bug de centrado: la animacion de \"flotar\" del holograma pisaba el\n  transform de centrado del oso; se fusionaron en un solo keyframe.\n- Se oculto .current-step (redundante con la nueva ventana de\n  instrucciones) y se recorto el bloque de briefing/help-box de la\n  barra lateral para reducir el scroll interno.","tree":{"sha":"6b4fe4be4a253c4608cb3bfb47804aae9a79d280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/6b4fe4be4a253c4608cb3bfb47804aae9a79d280"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/251cbc0ac09d99124ed3aa33ceb03a2de2c3a873","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/251cbc0ac09d99124ed3aa33ceb03a2de2c3a873","node_id":"C_kwDOT0zAydoAKDI1MWNiYzBhYzA5ZDk5MTI0ZWQzYWEzM2NlYjAzYTJkZTJjM2E4NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commit/91adcbd4b16116375b46035ec9083bdcf9a399b1","sha":"91adcbd4b16116375b46035ec9083bdcf9a399b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/commits/91adcbd4b16116375b46035ec9083bdcf9a399b1"}],"sha":"251cbc0ac09d9