 como texto fluido tipo\n  Claude; los mensajes del usuario mantienen su burbuja).\n- Scrollbar delgado y con color propio, más un botón flotante \"Ir al\n  final\" que aparece solo cuando el chat es largo y el usuario se\n  desplazó hacia arriba, sin forzar el scroll cada vez que llega un\n  mensaje nuevo.\n- pages/api/chat.js: INGenioso ahora tiene identidad propia también en\n  el modo general del sitio (antes solo se llamaba así dentro del\n  juego), consistente con el branding \"INGenioso.sh\" del widget.","tree":{"sha":"e4be86e4cf87c4dbbe77c2823857ebbbd91f3b9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/e4be86e4cf87c4dbbe77c2823857ebbbd91f3b9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/3f6b64c8a4e900e4550d941b8b1a4c9e462a98b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez/El-