l.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Agrega OpenRouter como segundo proveedor de IA (Groq → OpenRouter → NVIDIA)\n\nOrden reordenado por generosidad real del plan gratuito, verificado\nago/2026:\n- Groq: hasta ~14,400 req/día, se renueva cada día — el más generoso.\n- OpenRouter (nuevo): 50 req/día sin fondear vía el auto-router\n  \"openrouter/free\", que elige entre los modelos gratis disponibles\n  ese momento — se renueva cada día.\n- NVIDIA NIM: baja a tercer lugar — su \"free tier\" es un pozo fijo de\n  créditos totales (no diario), el menos sostenible de los tres.\n\nLa clave real vive solo en .env.local (gitignored); .env.local.example\ndocumenta las 3 variables sin exponer secretos.","tree":{"sha":"072f791f309ecb53c901cd4e8ad72ec4397bb785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/072f791f309ecb53c901cd4e8ad72ec4397bb785"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/3eeba1c692b68facfb0ef01ec91bcc37f0b2c895","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://