or":{"date":"2026-08-16T02:41:26Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T02:41:26Z","email":"ingmarlonperez2026@gmail.com","name":"ing-MarlonPerez"},"message":"Corrige superposición del título sobre la computadora en el boot\n\nEl título neón usaba position:absolute a una altura fija (top:6%),\nindependiente de la computadora centrada por flexbox — en pantallas\nbajas ambos se superponían. Ahora el título vive en el flujo normal\njunto con la computadora y el hint, así flexbox centra el bloque\ncompleto como una unidad, con el mismo espacio arriba y abajo\n(verificado: 108.56px vs 108.57px en 786px de alto; 4.58px vs 4.57px\nen 540px de alto).","tree":{"sha":"cc544a40e019ca39326ecfecab4f5397cf31058f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/cc544a40e019ca39326ecfecab4f5397cf31058f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/6a37eb8b39aa5b8c9a3241cd10b2d1f3f1d5f0fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip