izado con Web Audio API (tecleo, chime de etapa, jingle\n  final), boton de silenciar persistente en localStorage\n- Sistema de respuestas locales: pistas y glosario de ~22 conceptos resuelven\n  preguntas frecuentes sin llamar a /api/chat, cuidando la cuota diaria de IA\n- Nuevo docs/teoria-operacion-laboratorio-b.md: teoria aplicada de los 31\n  niveles organizada en 7 episodios, con glosario y referencias\n- README: banner ASCII, diagrama de episodios, seccion de niveles colapsable\n  y stack/roadmap actualizados","tree":{"sha":"af3a658427f4a29c91a687497349af13922ecdc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/trees/af3a658427f4a29c91a687497349af13922ecdc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IngMarlonPerez/El-Club-de-la-Ingenier-a/git/commits/b14189f754965905a2e67f14b461bb1bfa457650","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184309890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPerez","id":184309890,"login":"IngMarlonPerez","node_id":"U_kgDOCvxYgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IngMarlonPerez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IngMarlonPer