b7b60d3ae0c41f0c0fa626/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:16:27Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:16:27Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(tenancy): restore DB tenant context in background workers (RunsInTenantContext)\n\nLong-running processes (outbox poller, critical-value auto-escalator) run\noutside the HTTP middleware that sets the DB tenant GUCs, so under FORCED\nPostgreSQL RLS they got zero tenant access. Introduce RunsInTenantContext:\nwrap each job in a transaction, set transaction-local GUCs restored from the\nevent''s stored tenant/facility (is_local so they can never leak onto a reused\nconnection), run, then commit/rollback and reset.\n\nApply to ProcessOutbox and AutoEscalateCriticalValues, and widen the pending\nscope to include events with a null next_attempt_at.","tree":{"sha":"7ae6d1eb19201ba789765aff7868841c0ffed0fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/7ae6d1eb19201ba789765aff7868841c0ffed0fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/0672e118bb1d36804ab7b60d3ae0c41f0c0fa626","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/0672e118bb1d36804ab7b60d3ae0c41f0c0fa626","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKDA2NzJlMTE4YmIxZDM2ODA0YWI3YjYwZDNhZTBjNDFmMGMwZmE2MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8","sha":"27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8"}],"sha":"0672e118bb1d36804ab7b60d3ae0c41f0c0fa626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/0672e118bb1d36804ab7b60d3ae0c41f0c0fa626"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:16:15Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:16:15Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(tenancy): V2 lifecycle state machine, per-tenant throttle, module gate, data export\n\nAdd the organization lifecycle state machine (TENANCY.md V2 13):\nactive → suspended → closed → offboarded, with reactivation and close/offboard\nedges, enforced by the Organization model and platform-only endpoints; each\ntransition is audited and offboarding dispatches a transactional-outbox domain\nevent (OrganizationOffboardedHandler).\n\nAdd per-tenant request throttling (ThrottleTenant, TENANCY.md V2 7) keyed on the\nresolved tenant id AFTER ResolveTenantContext, so one tenant cannot starve\nanother behind the same IP/NAT; disabled by default.\n\nAdd backend-authoritative module gating (EnsureModuleEnabled): a request to a\nmodule not enabled for the current tenant is rejected regardless of client\nassertion.\n\nAdd tenant-scoped data export (data:export permission, TENANCY.md V2 15): a\nfacts-only bundle derived from server context only, archived to a tenant-scoped\npath, and audited. Read-only governance views now gate on audit:view.","tree":{"sha":"2ee4c27d7121e5a4e86ca149c79eafd61f80b00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/2ee4c27d7121e5a4e86ca149c79eafd61f80b00c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKDI3ZTk0MjA4M2VmZWE5M2FkZWE1YzQ3OWQxOGEyNzY1MGI5MDgxZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/53f8d49237a17ec1eba17ecd6ebd1a29115dd5c1","sha":"53f8d49237a17ec1eba17ecd6ebd1a29115dd5c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/53f8d49237a17ec1eba17ecd6ebd1a29115dd5c1"}],"sha":"27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/27e942083efea93adea5c479d18a27650b9081f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/53f8d49237a17ec1eba17ecd6ebd1a29115dd5c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:15:58Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T04:15:58Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(auth): DB-backed lockout, authenticated password change, breached-password rejection\n\nReplace the volatile in-memory Cache login-failure counter with a DB-backed\nper-account lockout (failed_attempts/locked_until/last_failed_at persisted on\nthe users row) so lockout survives restarts, cache eviction, and multi-node\ndeployments (SECURITY.md 18). Row-lock update serializes concurrent attempts so\nthe counter can never race.\n\nAdd authenticated password change (POST /auth/password/change): verifies the\ncurrent credential, enforces the shared 12-char strength floor, and revokes\nEVERY outstanding token and session per SECURITY.md 2/4/5.\n\nAdd k-anonymity breached-password rejection (SECURITY.md 2/20) via Have I Been\nPwned scope endpoint at login provisioning and change; only the SHA-1 prefix\nleaves the server; configurable fail-open/fail-closed policy.","tree":{"sha":"2eed6fa24fea95940694d082ef25d1f8ba3c4369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/2eed6fa24fea95940694d082ef25d1f8ba3c4369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/53f8d49237a17ec1eba17ecd6ebd1a29115dd5c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravata