aths instead of broken legacy redirects, and added\na `ParamRedirect` helper so bookmarked old URLs still work.\n\nIncludes Phase 215 (operations-admin-safety, 99 tests) and Phase 216\n(appointment-scheduling-safety, 129 tests).\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"635d498c5620d33bf5936b689a01cef3ff358795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/635d498c5620d33bf5936b689a01cef3ff358795"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/a4d9579595017a34b0443660b09b56f195c46b8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/a4d9579595017a34b0443660b09b56f195c46b8f","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKGE0ZDk1Nzk1OTUwMTdhMzRiMDQ0MzY2MGIwOWI1NmYxOTVjNDZiOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/68cabe85f9e0ed51e3ce26c878ba35f8992429a2","sha":"68cabe85f9e0ed51e3ce26c878ba35f8992429a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/68cabe85f9e0ed51e3ce26c878ba35f8992429a2"}],"sha":"a4d9579595017a34b0443660b09b56f195c46b8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/a4d9579595017a34b0443660b09b56f195c46b8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/68cabe85f9e0ed51e3ce26c878ba35f8992429a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:14:20Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:14:20Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"fix: handle referral 403 gracefully in clinical work sources\n\nThe hospital_admin role lacks referral:view permission, causing\nGET /api/v1/referrals to return 403. This broke the entire work queue\nand clinical command surface on the dashboard because useClinicalWorkSources\ntreated the 403 as a hard error.\n\nCatch the referrals API error and return an empty array instead, so\nroles without referral access still see appointments, queue, critical\nvalues, and radiology work.\n\n🤖 Generate