g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/ac13684d64029b7eb7e1220508127bbdeea0abbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:10:18Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:10:18Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(patient-workspace): introduce Universal Patient Workspace with pinned identity spine (Phase 117)\n\nPatientWorkspace enhanced with persistent patient identity and context lock:\n\n- CompactIdentitySpine: pinned bar at top of viewport after scrolling past\n  the full patient header, ensuring patient identity is never lost during\n  clinical work. Shows name, MRN, status, location, encounter count, and\n  a context-lock indicator.\n\n- Context Lock: visual signal (lock icon) indicating the patient context\n  is locked and must be explicitly changed.\n\n- Patient identity remains stable across all domain navigation (Overview,\n  Timeline, Clinical, Orders, Results, Medications, Billing).\n\n- IntersectionObserver-based spine visibility: spine appears only when\n  the full header scrolls out of view.\n\n- Light-only clinical design tokens throughout.\n\nVerification:\n- TypeScript: 0 errors\n- Frontend tests: 199/199 pass\n- Build: passes\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Author