thubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/40da5e6429aa4bcaba105ec92a7edd012cc89583/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:01:41Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:01:41Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(ux): introduce contextual action surfaces and global context bar (Phase 116)\n\nContextSurface replaces DomainCommandSurface with a richer clinical\naction launcher that understands urgency, role, and workflow position.\n\nContextBar adds a global context strip showing critical system-wide items\n(overdue appointments, waiting patients) derived from canonical state.\n\nInteraction model established:\n  DASHBOARD = situational awareness (\"What is happening?\")\n  CONTEXT SURFACE = task activation (\"What do I want to do?\")\n  WORKSPACE = perform the task\n\nComponents:\n- ContextSurface: enhanced action launcher with urgency indicators,\n  category grouping, keyboard navigation, role-aware filtering\n- ContextBar: persistent horizontal strip showing critical items\n- UrgencyIndicator: consistent urgency hierarchy (normal/info/attention/warning/critical)\n\nDesign constraints:\n- Light-only clinical design tokens\n- WCAG AA keyboard accessible (Tab, Escape, arrow navigation)\n- No route explosion — reuses existing routes\n- No duplicate patient state or authorization\n- No backend changes\n- Responsive: desktop grid, tablet 2-col, mobile stacked\n\nFiles:\n- contextual/ContextSurface.tsx (+180 lines)\n- contextual/context-surface.css (+280 lines)\n- contextual/ContextBar.tsx (+140 lines)\n- contextual/context-bar.css (+150 lines)\n- contextual/index.ts (barrel export)\n- contextual/ContextSurface.test.tsx (11 tests)\n- AppShell.tsx (ContextSurface replaces DomainCommandSurface, ContextBar added)\n\nVerification:\n- TypeScript: 0 errors\n- Frontend tests: 199/199 pass (188 existing + 11 new)\n- Build: passes\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"baf55403a8ef7a6f74dc9b397c86e19d5e1ea945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/baf55403a8ef7a6f74dc9b397c86e19d5e1ea945"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/40da5e6429aa4bcaba105ec92a7edd012cc89583","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/