":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/0acecca555b74b486d4e14543bad5675449237b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T12:19:30Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T12:19:30Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(workflow): introduce PatientJourney — one continuous thread through the hospital\n\nAdd PatientJourney component: an orchestration layer over canonical systems\nthat answers \"where is this patient now, what''s happening, what''s next?\"\n\nArchitecture: PATIENT → EPISODE → LOCATION → STATE → NEXT STEP\n\nPatientJourney features:\n- Journey state derived from real API data (encounters, appointments)\n- States: arrived, waiting, in-care, awaiting-diagnostics, admitted,\n  transferred, discharge-ready, discharged, follow-up\n- State indicator with semantic color and icon\n- Next-best-step with direct action button\n- Journey timeline showing recent events with status dots\n- Events: clinical, operational, diagnostic, financial, location, document\n- Patient context preserved throughout\n- Light-only, clinical design tokens\n- Keyboard accessible, screen-reader labeled\n- Responsive design\n\nIntegration:\n- Added as \"Journey\" tab in PatientWorkspace (available to all roles)\n- Uses existing patientsApi.show, encountersApi.forPatient, patientsApi.followUps\n- No new backend endpoints required\n- No duplicate patient/episode/timeline models\n\nThis is NOT a new patient record. It is a view that connects:\nregistration → appointment → encounter → order → result → review → follow-up\ninto one coherent story.\n\nTypeScript: 0 errors\nFrontend tests: 188/188 pass\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"82559b08133830477244d3c8cfca2d43212a7617","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/82559b08133830477244d3c8cfca2d43212a7617"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/0acecca555b74b486d4e14543bad5675449237b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/0acecca555b74b486d4e14543bad5675449237b6","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKDBhY2VjY2E1NTViNzRiNDg2ZDRlMTQ1NDNiYWQ1Njc1NDQ5MjM3YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/98a7688c4d082bb967c300de08b5051be302c4c3","sha":"98a7688c4d082bb967c300de08b5051be302c4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/98a7688c4d082bb967c300de08b5051be302c4c3"}],"sha":"0acecca555b74b486d4e14543bad5675449237b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/0acecca555b74b486d4e14543bad5675449237b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/98a7688c4d082bb967c300de08b5051be302c4c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T12:09:52Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T12:09:52Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(ux): introduce Workbench — unified workflow orchestration\n\nAdd the Workbench component: a coordination layer over canonical systems\n(appointments, encounters, orders) that answers \"what should I do next?\"\n\nArchitecture: ROLE → CURRENT WORK → PATIENT → CONTEXT → ACTION → NEXT\n\nWorkbench features:\n- Work items built from real API data (appointments, encounters)\n- Status: ready, waiting, blocked, completed, cancelled\n- Priority: critical, high, normal, low — sorted by urgency\n- Patient context preserved on each work item\n- Next-best-action on every item (Start consultation, Check in, etc.)\n- Summary stats: total, ready, waiting, blocked, critical, done\n- Status filtering with counts\n- Keyboard accessible, screen-reader labeled\n- Responsive: stacked mobile, 2-col tablet, list desktop\n- Light-only, clinical design tokens\n\nIntegration:\n- Added as first tab in StaffWorkspace (\"My Work\")\n- Existing tabs (Today, Appointments, Encounters, etc.) preserved\n- Workbench provides the workflow-orchestration view\n\nThis is NOT a new task engine. It is a view over existing canonical\nrecords that surfaces what matters now, for whom, and what to do next.\n\nTypeScript: 0 errors\nFrontend tests: 188/188 pass\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"0039693bb59f9fffdb4a0e8028d03eb309d75adb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/0039693bb59f9fffdb4a0e8028d03eb309d75adb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/98a7688c4d082bb967c300de08b5051be302c4c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u