s/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/f611f92470ad2904f252877f35bf84bd9bdfcce3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:54:59Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:54:59Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"refactor(ui): make SWASTHYA light-mode only — remove dark theme\n\nSWASTHYA is a clinical instrument. It is light mode only.\nNo dark theme, no auto theme, no theme toggle.\n\nRemoved:\n- Dark mode token overrides from tokens.css (~250 lines)\n- dark.css dark-mode component overrides (~60 lines)\n- ThemeToggle component from ui.tsx\n- prefers-color-scheme/data-theme selectors from base.css\n- Dark mode login styles from login.css\n- Unused useState import from ui.tsx\n\nRetained:\n- All clinical design tokens (teal palette, typography, spacing, etc.)\n- PatientBanner, CommandCenterCard, ClinicalValue, Toast components\n- Light-mode-only surface hierarchy\n- Accessibility tokens (focus ring, reduced motion, tabular numerals)\n\nSWASTHYA visual identity:\nSOFT LIGHT BACKGROUND → CLEAN WHITE SURFACES → DEEP TEAL ACTIONS\n→ SUBTLE SEMANTIC TINTS → STRONG CLINICAL TYPOGRAPHY\n\nTypeScript: 0 errors\nFrontend tests: 188/188 pass\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"36743905eec5a06b5b