 logo: #1570ef → #0f766e (teal-700)\n- HospitalOnboarding SVG logo: #1570ef → #0f766e (teal-700)\n- FormsPage category chips: #2e90fa → var(--teal-600)\n- Login page background gradients: blue → teal\n- Login environment badge: hardcoded → var(--amber-*) tokens\n- Orchestration tabs: hardcoded blue → var(--interactive-primary)\n\nFully migrated CSS files:\n- cdss-warning.css (CDSS drug interaction alerts)\n- workforce-cmd.css (admin workforce management)\n- ai-assist.css (AI governance dashboard)\n- analytics-cmd.css (analytics command center)\n- login.css (login page)\n\nAccessibility:\n- All migrated files use visible focus ring via var(--focus-ring)\n- Tabular numerals on census/value displays\n- Reduced-motion respected in all animations\n\nTypeScript: 0 errors\nFrontend tests: 188/188 pass\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9ff8870f3dc3b6397d8b2901c5d2bc014b14786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/c9ff8870f3dc3b6397d8b2901c5d2bc014b14786"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/a3f215bfd3386117428cb425a12cc980f7685c1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/a3f215bfd3386117428cb425a12cc980f7685c1b","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKGEzZjIxNWJmZDMzODYxMTc0MjhjYjQyNWExMmNjOTgwZjc2ODVjMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05","sha":"1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05"}],"sha":"a3f215bfd3386117428cb425a12cc980f7685c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/a3f215bfd3386117428cb425a12cc980f7685c1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:14:09Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:14:09Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat(design): implement clinical-grade design system with teal palette and dark mode\n\nReplace generic SaaS-blue tokens with a deep teal clinical palette, add\nfirst-class dark mode for night-shift staff, and introduce core clinical\ncomponents (PatientBanner/Identity Spine, CommandCenterCard, ClinicalValue,\nToast, ThemeToggle). Aligns the frontend implementation with DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.\n\nDesign token changes:\n- Primary accent: blue (#2e90fa) → teal (#0f766e) — calm, distinctive, AA-compliant\n- Body text: 14px → 16px mobile / 15px desktop for low-cost screen legibility\n- Font stack: Public Sans (body) + Manrope (display) + IBM Plex Mono (identifiers)\n- Tabular numerals mandated for all numeric data (vitals, labs, billing)\n- Radius tightened: 4/6/10/12px — instrument, not toy\n- Touch targets added: 44px minimum, 48px clinical rows\n- Semantic tint surfaces (10-15% opacity) for status chips\n\nDark mode (full implementation):\n- Dual trigger: prefers-color-scheme + data-theme attribute\n- Floor: #121620 (dark navy, never pure black)\n- Ceiling: #f0f2f5 (soft gray-white, never pure white)\n- Clinical data gets highest contrast; interface furniture recedes\n- Focus ring, shadows, skeletons all adapted for dark surfaces\n- Respects prefers-reduced-motion\n\nClinical components:\n- PatientBanner (Identity Spine): sticky patient identity bar, always visible\n  in clinical context, carries name/MRN/age/sex/allergies — safety device\n- CommandCenterCard: role-aware dashboard tile with urgency encoding\n- ClinicalValue: lab/vital display with unit, reference range, ↑/↓ status\n- Toast: positioned notification with action support\n- ThemeToggle: light/dark/auto cycle with localStorage persistence\n\nBackward compatibility: all legacy CSS aliases preserved (--teal-*, --ink-*,\n--sp-*, --fs-*, --line-*, --paper-*, --gradient-*).\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"0635ec096d83c0ba80e33532bfb67b44be6440c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/0635ec096d83c0ba80e33532bfb67b44be6440c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKDFhYjgwZTllNDFhMzU0NTIxMGUxNzVkYmJkYjU5NDVlNWJkMGFhMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/3e8400c6f7362ed31e25ffcee969fda85860d8e4","sha":"3e8400c6f7362ed31e25ffcee969fda85860d8e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/3e8400c6f7362ed31e25ffcee969fda85860d8e4"}],"sha":"1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/1ab80e9e41a3545210e175dbbdb5945e5bd0aa05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/3e8400c6f7362ed31e25ffcee969fda85860d8e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T07:59:16Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T07:59:16Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"security: add RLS to 17 unprotected application tables and close security gate\n\nAdd row-level security policies to 17 application tables that had\ntenant_id/facility_id columns but lacked database-level RLS:\n\naccounts, accounts_payable, corrective_actions, disclosure_logs,\ndocument_acknowledgements, document_versions, domain_events,\ndrug_interactions, hospital_documents, hospital_incidents,\nhospital_policies, journal_entries, journal_lines, patient_complaints,\nqueue_entries, resource_bookings, staff_credentials.\n\nMigration: 2026_08_27_100000_add_rls_to_17_unprotected_application_tables.php\n- Enables RLS on all 17 tables\n- Adds SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE policies scoped by tenant_id\n- drug_interactions uses tenant-only scoping (no facility_id column)\n\nTests added:\n- RlsEnforcementTest (13/13): forged-claims, cross-facility, cross-tenant\n  UPDATE/DELETE, single-table sensitive data protection\n\nTests fixed:\n- SecurityReconciliationTest (16/16): strict expected set of 11\n  unprotected auth tables, conditional Supabase role tests, has_table_privilege\n\nPolicy count: 794 → 862 (143+ tables with RLS)\nTables without RLS: 11 (auth infrastructure only, documented)\n\nPhase 100.7 complete. Security gate closed. Phase 1–100 program complete.\n\nGenerated with Codebuff 🤖\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1049db1114f1ead4de4ded5cdcddffa551423a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/f1049db1114f1ead4de4ded5cdcddffa551423a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/3e8400c6f7362ed31e25ffcee969fda85860d8e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commit/3e8400c6f7362ed31e25ffcee969fda85860d8e4","node_id":"C_kwDOT01FpdoAKDNl