:"2026-08-26T17:16:04Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"accessibility: add WCAG-aligned auditing, Nepal UX validation, and clinical safety checks\n\nPhase 94 establishes SWASTHYA''s accessibility and Nepal-First UX hardening:\n- AccessibilityService with WCAG 2.2 AA checks (keyboard, ARIA, contrast, touch, typography)\n- Nepal localization validation (Nepali/English, NPR currency, Asia/Kathmandu timezone, phone format)\n- Clinical UI safety checks (identity spine, high-risk confirmation, medication safety)\n- 19 automated tests covering all accessibility, localization, and clinical safety rules\n- Comprehensive documentation of responsive design, low-bandwidth, and browser support\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"c47cfed25aded07d5a0cf4919575ff4765f675aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/c47cfed25aded07d5a0cf4919575ff4765f675aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/2ac2067e83b35ea66975ff1893447e745fbc7c13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_id":"U_kgDOD4mJcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/subscriptions","ty