/b4snet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/commits/5b0e92f7aaa709009ab90c4222a2157098776e98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T16:56:15Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T16:56:15Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"ops: add hospital deployment checklist and realistic Nepal data seeder\n\nCreate HOSPITAL_DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md with step-by-step provisioning\nguide for Render + Supabase (Dockerfile, render.yaml, smoke_staging.sh\nall referenced). Create NepalHospitalSeeder with realistic Birat Teaching\nHospital data: 17 departments, 7 wards, 90+ beds, 23 services with NPR\npricing, 20 Nepal medications, 19 staff with Nepal names, 80 patients,\nencounters, diagnoses, prescriptions, lab orders, 5 admissions, and 30\ninvoices with 13% VAT. Seeder refuses production. PHP syntax verified,\n112/112 frontend tests pass.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab1d593454f9a671bfd137ddef3389828aa3201f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/ab1d593454f9a671bfd137ddef3389828aa3201f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/5b0e92f7aaa709009ab90c4222a2157098776e98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/b4snet","id":260671858,"login":"b4snet","node_