,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:06:51Z","email":"dipsonbasnet95@gmail.com","name":"Dipson Basnet"},"message":"feat: build hospital orchestration — queue, resource booking, capacity, patient flow and OrchestrationPage\n\nAdd complete hospital orchestration infrastructure:\n- QueueEntry model with priority-based queue management and token system\n- ResourceBooking model with conflict detection for OT, imaging, equipment, rooms, beds\n- OrchestrationController with 12 methods: enqueue, queue management, resource booking, provider availability, hospital capacity, patient flow, orchestration dashboard\n- 12 API routes under /api/v1/orchestration/* with authorize:clinical middleware\n- OrchestrationPage with 4 tabs: Overview (capacity census + patient flow), Queue (enqueue, call next, start, complete), Resources (book, cancel, list), Patient Flow\n- Resource conflict detection prevents double-booking of the same resource\n- Hospital capacity endpoint aggregates beds, theatres, appointments, referrals\n- Patient flow tracks arrivals → check-in → consultation → completion\n- Sidebar navigation added under Operations for admin roles\n- i18n English and Nepali translations\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"73651e52832d6e5ddca65523092d18ce873cc75f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/trees/73651e52832d6e5ddca65523092d18ce873cc75f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/b4snet/swasthya-nepal/git/commits/00ee25b2e85b4f6cc29da56428e9b49fd06bb55b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260671858?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b4snet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user