repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brucearctor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brucearctor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divergedev/demo/commits/1939d7bde62935ae3cbf352a15ef61d2bc9c9b31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:51:03Z","email":"5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bruce Arctor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:51:03Z","email":"5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bruce Arctor"},"message":"refactor: monorepo — move services into repo, remove git clone step\n\nDevRel-friendly refactor: all 5 services now live in services/ as\nplain directories instead of being cloned from separate GitHub repos.\n\nBenefits:\n- git clone + ./scripts/setup.sh — that''s it, zero network deps\n- One PR changes everything (scripts + services together)\n- No version drift between repos\n- No GitHub rate-limiting or auth issues during setup\n\nChanges:\n- services/{payments-api,accounts-api,gateway,web-app,payments-module}/\n  moved from .services/demo-* (separate repos) to committed dirs\n- setup.sh: removed clone step (9→8 steps), builds from services/\n- preview.sh: updated paths to services/payments-api\n- preview-frontend.sh: updated paths to services/payments-module\n- .gitignore: ignore compiled Go binaries","tree":{"sha":"a778a2cb8a9f83f22be0f27715940da79ed3ff8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divergedev/demo/git/trees/a778a2cb8a9f83f22be0f27715940da79ed3ff8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divergedev/demo/git/commits/1939d7bde62935ae3cbf352a15ef61d2bc9c9b31","verification":{"payload":"tree a778a2cb8a9f83f22be0f27715940da79ed3ff8c\nparent 9a6b74508c0aa585133b3b1edc8f11dade6222c1\nauthor Bruce Arctor <5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com> 1786567863 -0700\ncommitter Bruce Arctor <5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com> 1786567863 -0700\n\nrefactor: monorepo — move services into repo,