://api.github.com/users/brucearctor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divergedev/demo/commits/5d411bd60bb631eae2d1fe93acc0a3474a54c32a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:58:32Z","email":"5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bruce Arctor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:58:32Z","email":"5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bruce Arctor"},"message":"feat: add frontend Module Federation preview support\n\nPhase 2c — demonstrates preview environments for frontend modules:\n\n- New payments-module service (Go + embedded JS, simulated MF remote)\n- Gateway gets /api/module-registry (preview-aware module URL resolution)\n- Gateway gets /modules/* proxy (dynamic service routing)\n- Shell dynamically loads modules from registry-provided URLs\n- preview-frontend.sh creates frontend-only preview environments\n- setup.sh deploys payments-module as 5th baseline service\n\nModule Registry pattern: shell asks gateway for module URLs,\ngateway discovers preview pods and returns preview URLs when\nx-preview-id header is present. No controller changes needed.","tree":{"sha":"6bf3789a3cff618aed54cfe80515d5280f4c807c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divergedev/demo/git/trees/6bf3789a3cff618aed54cfe80515d5280f4c807c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divergedev/demo/git/commits/5d411bd60bb631eae2d1fe93acc0a3474a54c32a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bf3789a3cff618aed54cfe80515d5280f4c807c\nparent 9f44d1ff06f6db9a164c481ecf3430705d1eb265\nauthor Bruce Arctor <5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com> 1786564712 -0700\ncommitter Bruce Arctor <5032356+brucearctor@users.noreply.github.com> 1786564712 -0700\n\nfeat: add frontend Module Federation preview support\n\nPhase 2c — demonstrates preview environments for frontend modules:\n\n- New payments-module service (Go + embedded JS, simulated MF remote)\n- Gateway gets /api/module-registry (preview-aware module URL reso