ame":"GameAnimeCode"},"message":"docs: rewrite the README and add docs/ with draw.io diagrams\n\nRestructures the README as a landing page and moves the depth into four\nguides: Module Federation concepts, the two HMR approaches, dynamic\ndiscovery, and building a federated app from scratch. Adds a fifth on\ntheming across the boundary.\n\nDiagrams are SVGs with an embedded mxfile, so they render on GitHub and\nopen editable in app.diagrams.net.","tree":{"sha":"987ea45e559e4f485745536eb87c95f1f2b205c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GameAnimeCode/module-federation/git/trees/987ea45e559e4f485745536eb87c95f1f2b205c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GameAnimeCode/module-federation/git/commits/7f0e4a218e7f5f6062628c1fbb56e5b52b968d49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305609563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GameAnimeCode","id":305609563,"login":"GameAnimeCode","node_id":"U_kgDOEjc7Ww","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GameAnimeCode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GameAnimeCode/module-federation/commit/7f0e4a218e7f5f6062628c1fbb56e5b52b968d49","node_id":"C_kwDOT06kB9oAKDdmMG