mments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:37:36Z","email":"erandi201326@gmail.com","name":"epamudika"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:37:36Z","email":"erandi201326@gmail.com","name":"epamudika"},"message":"feat: implement Dijkstra''s algorithm and related components\n\n- Added Dijkstra''s algorithm implementation in src/algorithms/dijkstra.js.\n- Created ComparisonTable component for displaying algorithm results in src/components/ComparisonTable.jsx.\n- Developed ControlPanel component for user interactions in src/components/ControlPanel.jsx.\n- Introduced GraphCanvas component for visualizing graphs in src/components/GraphCanvas.jsx.\n- Added ResultsPanel component to show algorithm results in src/components/ResultsPanel.jsx.\n- Implemented DisjointSet data structure in src/data-structures/DisjointSet.js.\n- Created Graph data structure for managing nodes and edges in src/data-structures/Graph.js.\n- Added MinHeap data structure for priority queue functionality in src/data-structures/MinHeap.js.\n- Generated sample networks for testing in src/data/networks.js.\n- Developed useRouteOptimizer hook for managing routing logic in src/hooks/useRouteOptimizer.js.\n- Configured webpack for testing in webpack.test.config.js.","tree":{"sha":"dfd5c8974b3f831e2c0796ba07e515895fd881c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KaSaNaa/module-route-optimizer/git/trees/dfd5c8974b3f831e2c0796ba07e515895fd881c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KaSaNaa/module-route-optimizer/git/commits/fc72aba562cbdf8193e4f65e949109e3d27c6609","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169815563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/epamudika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/epamudika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/epamudika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git