itha123@gmail.com","name":"KaSaNaa"},"message":"Suppress dev-server overlay for caught runtime errors\n\nErrors caught by the host''s ModuleErrorBoundary were still popping\nthis module''s webpack-dev-server overlay, because the react/react-dom\nsingleton shared with the host can end up running from this module''s\nbundle. Disabling the runtimeErrors overlay lets the host''s own\nfallback UI show instead, while compile errors still surface normally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa3c1c3580e89539b24679aabe4f9b21b5573bbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KaSaNaa/module-resource-allocator/git/trees/aa3c1c3580e89539b24679aabe4f9b21b5573bbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KaSaNaa/module-resource-allocator/git/commits/1144b23bcbc3047306db95bf04f00643cfefc551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78403419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaSaNaa","id":78403419,"login":"KaSaNaa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NDAzNDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaSaNaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KaSaNaa/module-resource-allocator/commit/1144b23bcbc3047306db95bf04f00643cfefc551","node_id":"C_kwDOT1DootoAKDE