it, eslint-plugin-boundaries silently no-ops on every \"@/...\"\n  path-aliased import, which is how this whole repo imports.\n- Split PanelManager''s non-JSX logic into features/panel-state/usePanelManager.ts;\n  introduce pages/workspace/WorkspacePage.tsx as the single composition root\n  that wires MapSurface, toolbars, PanelChrome, DockOverlay,\n  WorkspaceSettingsButton, WorkspaceTaskbar, and AppLauncher together.\n- WorkspaceTaskbar takes its launcher as a ReactNode slot instead of\n  importing AppLauncher directly.\n- Move ElementContextMenuState out of the element-context-menu widget and\n  into the map-layers feature that actually computes it, fixing a\n  features-importing-from-widgets layer violation the resolver fix exposed.\n- Update CLAUDE.md and map-app''s README to document the pages-as-\n  composition-root convention and widget sibling isolation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bff3b88606371d75c3f5279a34cf9f10822b6e6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qsl17/tactical-map/git/trees/bff3b88606371d75c3f5279a34cf9f10822b6e6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qsl17/tactical-map/git/commits/adab8cdae24f338ef4ac6974545f81d70b396bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/qsl17/tactical-map/commit/adab8cdae24f338ef4ac6974545f81d70b396bc6","node_id":"C_kwDOT1S-u9oAKGFkYWI4Y2RhZTI0ZjMzOGVmNGFjNjk3NDU0NWY4MWQ3MGIzOTZiYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/qsl17/tactical-map/commit/e55693419acbdb22ad195cfafb8dc8126e3f418e","sha":"e55693419acbdb22ad195cfafb8dc8126e3f418e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qsl17/tactical-map/commits/e55693419acbdb22ad195cfafb8dc8126e3f418e"}],"sha":"adab8cdae24f338ef4ac6974545f81d70b396bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qsl17/tactical-map/commits/adab8cdae24f338ef4ac6974545f81d70b396bc6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qsl1