":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"ci: move build-and-deploy to the current action majors\n\ncheckout v4 -> v7, pnpm/action-setup v4 -> v6, setup-node v4 -> v7 and the four\ndocker actions one major up each: setup-buildx v3 -> v4, login v3 -> v4,\nmetadata v5 -> v6, build-push v5 -> v7. All of them still ran on the Node 20\nruntime the runners now force onto Node 24.\n\nNone of the removed inputs are used here: setup-buildx is called bare, and the\nmetadata tags carry no inline comment for the new list parser to read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9b2ec3f08fe9f96b9e7400c11da93c23c5c2c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/b9b2ec3f08fe9f96b9e7400c11da93c23c5c2c34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/f4d07fbf446f2059fa01fcb2b1f2624b4d1c68fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/f4d07fbf446f2059fa01fcb2b1f2624b4d1c68fb","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKGY0ZDA3ZmJmNDQ2ZjIwNTlmYTAxZmNiMmIxZjI2MjRiNGQxYzY4ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726","sha":"4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726"}],"sha":"f4d07fbf446f2059fa01fcb2b1f2624b4d1c68fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/f4d07fbf446f2059fa01fcb2b1f2624b4d1c68fb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:17:32Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:17:32Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"chore: update the dependencies\n\nEverything moves to its latest release, with two deliberate exceptions:\n\n- TypeScript stays on 5.9.3. 7.0.2 is out, but it removes options the\n  templates still declare, vue-tsc crashes loading it, and @ngtools/webpack\n  fails to initialise the Angular compiler with it.\n- Angular stays on the 21 line: @angular/compiler-cli 22 peer-requires\n  typescript >=6.0 <6.1, and 6.0 has only ever been published as a beta.\n\nAlso drops @types/webpack-dev-server, a deprecated stub package —\nwebpack-dev-server ships its own types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae2f52cd01fb734e8e98964a704192e74a5ded95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/ae2f52cd01fb734e8e98964a704192e74a5ded95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDRlMDE5NTJmNTc3NWE0YjAzNTkyNDdjMzAwN2Q2OTgwMzM2MTY3MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073","sha":"2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073"}],"sha":"4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/4e01952f5775a4b0359247c3007d698033616726"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:10:09Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:10:09Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"chore: require client SDK ^0.1.1\n\n0.1.0 declares `environment` as a required key of OrchestratorConfig, which\ndoes not match how the templates call configure().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3664fce5c169831a3f37ef6c826b72892af1f1bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/3664fce5c169831a3f37ef6c826b72892af1f1bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDJjNjFhNWExOWExNjNmMTkzZTRmN2ZjN2Q0YjYxNTQ5NDc3NjUwNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e","sha":"242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e"}],"sha":"2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/2c61a5a19a163f193e4f7fc7d4b6154947765073"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T08:33:04Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T08:33:04Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"feat: read the orchestrator domain from MICROFRONTEND_ORCHESTRATOR_DOMAIN\n\nThe publish step no longer hardcodes the console URL: it reads the\nMICROFRONTEND_ORCHESTRATOR_DOMAIN repository variable and falls back to\nhttps://console.mfe-orchestrator.dev when it is unset. Renamed from\nORCHESTRATOR_DOMAIN so it matches MICROFRONTEND_ORCHESTRATOR_API_KEY.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5f2dcdc9f945bfcc97b7927e2c5250c114adc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/c5f2dcdc9f945bfcc97b7927e2c5250c114adc26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDI0MmEwNTRkMzU5OTc3NjhhOGM2YjgyM2JiNTlkNDE4ODBkMDRmM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771","sha":"a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771"}],"sha":"242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/242a054d35997768a8c6b823bb59d41880d04f3e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T19:03:09Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T19:03:09Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"docs: drop the stale notice about the SDK being unpublished\n\n@mfe-orchestrator-hub/client is on npm, so pnpm install no longer 404s.\nThe caveat about the caret range on a 0.x version still holds and is kept.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec21efcab5efbc92a90d103e530cf6ac37be1331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/ec21efcab5efbc92a90d103e530cf6ac37be1331"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKGEyYTFmN2FhZDMwYjYzMGM4MzFiYTBlYTczZDlkNzM0Mzk1NjE3NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88","sha":"4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88"}],"sha":"a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/a2a1f7aad30b630c831ba0ea73d9d73439561771"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T18:44:45Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T18:44:45Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"fix: ship the application entry point in the production build\n\n`vite build` produced a dist/ with no entry chunk at all: index.html lost its\n<script> tag, src/main.ts was nowhere in the bundle, and nothing called\nconfigure() or bootstrapApplication() in production. The build still exited 0,\nwhich is why it went unnoticed.\n\nThe cause was not Module Federation. It is @analogjs/vite-plugin-angular, not\nesbuild, that compiles this app, and it does so by running the TypeScript\nprogram''s emit through tsconfig.app.json, which inherited \"noEmit\": true from\ntsconfig.json. Emit therefore produced nothing, the plugin handed Vite an empty\nmodule for src/main.ts, the html entry chunk collapsed to nothing and Vite\ndropped the script tag. Setting \"noEmit\": false on the config the plugin\ncompiles with restores the emit; nothing lands on disk, the plugin clears\noutDir and captures the output in memory.\n\nWith the entry back, a second failure surfaced: the app bootstrapped and died\nwith \"JIT compiler unavailable\". Rollup runs every plugin''s buildStart in\nparallel and starts loading the chunks emitted from it immediately, so\nvite-plugin-federation pulls in the module listed in `exposes` while the\nAngular compilation started by the plugin''s own buildStart is still running.\nThe plugin has nothing to return for it, Vite falls back to a plain esbuild\ntranspile, and the exposed component ships with its decorators uncompiled. A\nsmall wait-for-angular-compilation plugin holds transforms until that first\ncompilation has settled.\n\nremoteEntry.js and `exposes: { ''./App'': ... }` are untouched and still emitted.\nFixing the race also lifts the restriction documented in app.component.ts: an\nexposed component can import child components again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"946c508e5cebca707ce8d9c63cde5e2040ea3769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/946c508e5cebca707ce8d9c63cde5e2040ea3769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDRhZDEwNDMwNGFhNDc1MmZkZTNiMmM3ZmRlOGNiYzE0ZDY4ZDVlODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c","sha":"678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c"}],"sha":"4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/4ad104304aa4752fde3b2c7fde8cbc14d68d5e88"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T17:57:56Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T17:57:56Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"refactor: match the conditional spread the other host templates use\n\nEvery other host template drops the environment key from the object it\nhands to configure(); this one passed it explicitly as undefined. Both\nreach the same auto route, since the client only tests the value for\ntruthiness, but these files are read as examples and one idiom for one\nproblem is easier to copy correctly. The trim also catches a value that\nis only whitespace, which the previous `|| undefined` let through.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f2235c76308b8d9b5bcbc57349adec82eda9f53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/1f2235c76308b8d9b5bcbc57349adec82eda9f53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDY3OGUwM2IxODI0YzA1ODE0YmNjNWZmNjM3NzIwMDRiMmY5ZmYxM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02","sha":"c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02"}],"sha":"678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/678e03b1824c05814bcc5ff63772004b2f9ff13c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T17:34:41Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T17:34:41Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"feat: make the orchestrator environment optional\n\nThe client SDK no longer requires an environment: with none configured it calls\nGET /serve/all/auto/{projectId} and the backend resolves the environment from the\ndomain the request comes from. A host that is served from one domain per\nenvironment no longer has to know, or be told, which one it is running in, so a\nsingle build can serve staging and production.\n\nThe template kept forcing the value through anyway. Vite has two ways of saying\n\"not set\" -- a variable missing from .env arrives as undefined, one declared with\nno value arrives as an empty string -- and both used to reach configure() as-is,\nthe second one as a bogus \"\" slug that the backend would never match. The entry\npoint now collapses both into a real absence before handing the config over, and\nthe ImportMetaEnv declaration marks the variable optional so the compiler agrees.\n\nNothing changes for hosts that do set VITE_MFE_ENVIRONMENT: the slug is passed\nthrough untouched.\n\nNote this is the orchestrator''s environment (the slug, ex. \"DEV\"), not Angular''s\nenvironment.ts configuration files -- which this template does not use, and which\nare left alone. The README now says so, since the two names collide.\n\n`pnpm build` passes. `tsc --noEmit` still reports src/main.ts as\n\"Type ''string | undefined'' is not assignable to type ''string''\", because the\npublished @mfe-orchestrator-hub/client@0.1.0 still declares `environment: string`\nas required. That is a dependency on the core release, not a defect here, so it\nis left unmasked rather than silenced with a cast: the error disappears once the\nSDK ships `environment?: string`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3ed1f68be7f4c0b206245b06db408176e7341c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/e3ed1f68be7f4c0b206245b06db408176e7341c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKGM5NGI3MzRhODdmMzM5YTNkY2ZiMmE0NjIwMWI4ZThkMDJkM2NmMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375","sha":"a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375"}],"sha":"c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/c94b734a87f339a3dcfb2a46201b8e8d02d3cf02"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:16:23Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:16:23Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"chore(deps): pin pnpm 11.21.0 and fix the SDK microfrontend type import\n\nAdd packageManager: pnpm@11.21.0 and drop the hardcoded version: 10 input\nfrom pnpm/action-setup, so the action derives the version from packageManager\nand CI and local development share a single source of truth.\n\nDeliberately staying on vite 7. On vite 8 the build still exits 0 and still\nwrites assets/remoteEntry.js, but @analogjs/vite-plugin-angular emits the\nexposed ./App module as a 0 byte file and the SDK disappears from the bundle\nentirely, so the container would resolve ./App to an empty module at runtime.\nThe plugin''s peerDependencies claim vite ^8 support; that metadata does not\nhold in combination with @originjs/vite-plugin-federation.\n\nAlso fix a pre-existing break: the template imported the type\nMicrofrontendEntry, which the published @mfe-orchestrator-hub/client@0.1.0 does\nnot export. It exports Microfrontend, the element type of\nmanifest().microfrontends, which is what this component uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b82ffce831f364951c6f7962ad3eaf0e3b00d412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/b82ffce831f364951c6f7962ad3eaf0e3b00d412"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKGE0MDA4ODM1OTMzMjNjOGZmOTliMzcwZTcyZTM3ZTY5ZTA2ZGQzNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986","sha":"5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986"}],"sha":"a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/a400883593323c8ff99b370e72e37e69e06dd375"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:33:14Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:33:14Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"fix: require @mfe-orchestrator-hub/client ^0.1.0\n\nThe SDK ships as 0.1.0, so the previous ^1.0.0 range would not have resolved\nagainst the published package. A caret on a 0.x version is narrow by design\n(>=0.1.0 <0.2.0), which the README now states, together with the fact that the\nrange has to be widened by hand when the SDK moves to 0.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2a4d6a77699814657cf4901663e892a0d5a7895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/d2a4d6a77699814657cf4901663e892a0d5a7895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDVlZDVkYzk3NjE1Y2E2N2ZkNWMwYjlmZWZjMjEyMTBmOWNmOTI5ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9","sha":"932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9"}],"sha":"5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/5ed5dc97615ca67fd5c0b9fefc21210f9cf92986"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:28:28Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:28:28Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"refactor: use the @mfe-orchestrator-hub npm scope for the client SDK\n\nThe npm organisation is mfe-orchestrator-hub, so the SDK package is\n@mfe-orchestrator-hub/client. Renamed in the dependency, in the configure()\nimport of the entry point, in the bare specifier inside the federation config\nand in the README. The GitHub org stays mfe-orchestrator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4da435f70ab23774055ddc3120e5c986c7074d82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/4da435f70ab23774055ddc3120e5c986c7074d82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKDkzMjYwOWExMGI4ODEzMjVjMTBhY2Y3ODYwOGUzNWRjZDRlNDhkYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52","sha":"d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52"}],"sha":"932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/932609a10b881325c10acf78608e35dcd4e48da9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:17:56Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:17:56Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"refactor: use the @mfe-orchestrator npm scope for the client SDK\n\nThe SDK package is published as @mfe-orchestrator/client, not\n@mfe-orchestrator-hub/client. Renamed in the dependency, in the configure()\nimport of the entry point, in the bare specifier inside the federation config\nand in the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"767e21a73ce737410b2293b037b24afbf318891d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/trees/767e21a73ce737410b2293b037b24afbf318891d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/git/commits/d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52","node_id":"C_kwDOT1UmwdoAKGQ1ZGNmYTBjNzA5ZTM2NDE4NGU3NzAwMzA4MjA3NjZjM2E4MzhiNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commit/b5448c5d25cd0044a980d18fb3d0fc4aa9e1f362","sha":"b5448c5d25cd0044a980d18fb3d0fc4aa9e1f362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/b5448c5d25cd0044a980d18fb3d0fc4aa9e1f362"}],"sha":"d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/d5dcfa0c709e364184e770030820766c3a838b52"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-angular-host/commits/b5448c5d25cd0044a980d18fb3d0fc4aa9e1f362/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:52:33Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:52:33Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"feat: initial template\n\nVite + Angular host template for MFE Orchestrator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":