ntent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/2b126e7e3684737c721f9ab3ccaf02c2e9b622e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T13:13:39Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T13:13:39Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Le référent de « les deux artefacts » était ambigu\n\nL''étape 2 de la maquette affiche la première ligne de deux artefacts et conclut « les\ndeux artefacts contiennent l''import ». Onze lignes plus bas, l''étape 3 dit désormais\nque trois artefacts importent le socle.\n\nLes deux phrases sont exactes et ne parlent pas des mêmes objets : la première désigne\nles deux fichiers dont on vient de lire l''en-tête, la seconde compte tous les\nimporteurs du socle, mf-calcul compris. Mais un lecteur voit deux et trois à onze\nlignes d''écart, et rien ne lui dit que le référent a changé.\n\nLa phrase nomme donc son référent. Aucun nombre n''est modifié.","tree":{"sha":"1d0fac354546c3f38d76637fee1c585b1fb2aee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/1d0fac354546c3f38d76637fee1c585b1fb2aee2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/2b126e7e3684737c721f9ab3ccaf02c2e9b622e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/2b126e7e3684737c721f9ab3ccaf02c2e9b622e1","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKDJiMTI2ZTdlMzY4NDczN2M3MjFmOWFiM2NjYWYwMmMyZTliNjIyZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192","sha":"cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192"}],"sha":"2b126e7e3684737c721f9ab3ccaf02c2e9b622e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/2b126e7e3684737c721f9ab3ccaf02c2e9b622e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T12:49:35Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T12:49:35Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"La prose avait dérivé du code, et rien ne la vérifie\n\nSept affirmations des documents étaient devenues fausses. Aucune n''a été introduite\npar une erreur : chacune correspond à un changement volontaire et daté, que la prose\nn''a pas suivi. Le code est vérifié mécaniquement — typecheck, invariant de frontière,\nrecette — la prose ne l''est par personne. C''est très exactement la thèse du dépôt,\nappliquée au dépôt lui-même.\n\nRègle suivie : la documentation va vers le code.\n\n  - les socles 1.0 et 2.0, supprimés en d0ebac0, étaient encore cités comme s''ils\n    étaient servis ;\n  - les serveurs servent publie/ depuis qu''ils ont cessé de servir dist/, ce que le\n    tableau des origines n''avait pas enregistré ;\n  - trois comptes étaient restés à l''époque d''avant l''équipe calcul : trois dépôts au\n    lieu de quatre, six origines au lieu de sept, deux artefacts important le socle au\n    lieu de trois ;\n  - publier() ne rend plus un entier depuis le socle 3.0, mais un verdict. Quatre\n    passages annonçaient encore « 0 abonné » ou « 1 abonné », là où l''écran affiche\n    « charge conforme, mais aucun abonné ne l''écoutait » ou « remis à 2 abonné(s) » ;\n  - l''exemple de refus de la porte de combinaisons ne comportait pas mf-calcul, alors\n    que toute clé produite par combinaisonDe() compte quatre parties depuis son\n    arrivée. Il est désormais relevé sur la sortie réelle de basculer.mjs, pas rédigé.\n\nUne correction n''est pas une substitution. Le sous-titre de la page de coexistence\nracontait une migration — filtres passé en 2.0, tableau resté en 1.0. Or le socle 4.0\na une API strictement identique à la 3.0 : c''est un jumeau, pas une migration, et\nc''est délibéré depuis d0ebac0. Remplacer les numéros aurait rendu la phrase exacte et\nl''enseignement faux. Le sous-titre est réécrit autour de ce que la page démontre\nréellement : deux URL font deux instances, donc deux états. La réplique correspondante\ndu déroulé de présentation reçoit le même traitement.\n\nLe code portait lui aussi de la prose périmée — la bannière de servir.mjs, l''usage de\nconstruire.mjs, un libellé d''étape de la recette. Rien ne vérifie un commentaire ni une\nchaîne d''affichage : ils dérivent comme le reste.\n\nAucun comportement modifié. Recette complète verte.","tree":{"sha":"2000e394de6e618316eca1ec17f16e3d36f72ca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/2000e394de6e618316eca1ec17f16e3d36f72ca2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKGNmNWI1NTlkZmNkOWFiNDM3OTEwYTY2Y2NmYTFjNjZmMjI1NDMxOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069","sha":"d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069"}],"sha":"cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/cf5b559dfcd9ab437910a66ccfa1c66f22543192"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:54:35Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:54:35Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Plus aucune URL codée en dur dans le shell, et trois garde-fous contre le silence\n\nL''origine sans CORS était la dernière adresse écrite dans le code. Elle entre dans le\nmanifeste comme le dépôt concurrent — sans empreinte d''intégrité, délibérément : le\nnavigateur n''obtiendra jamais ce fichier, donc il n''aura jamais rien à vérifier, et en\ndéclarer une laisserait croire à un contrôle.\n\nLes deux essais de panne reposent sur des montages qui peuvent se dégrader en silence :\nune URL qui cesse d''exister, ou une origine qui se met à répondre correctement. Dans\nles deux cas l''essai continue de produire quelque chose, et ce quelque chose n''est plus\nla démonstration. C''est arrivé une fois, avec le dépôt concurrent.\n\nTrois vérifications l''empêchent désormais :\n  - le shell ne contient aucune URL codée en dur ;\n  - le manifeste décrit les deux montages de panne ;\n  - servir.mjs déclare toujours exactement une origine « cors: false », et le module\n    servi depuis elle existe toujours.\n\nLa dernière est la plus utile : si quelqu''un activait CORS sur ce port, l''essai\nchargerait le module avec succès et ne démontrerait plus rien — en ayant l''air de\nfonctionner.","tree":{"sha":"d5172185e335e22a203793842c10972ec5b3caae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/d5172185e335e22a203793842c10972ec5b3caae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKGQ5NmVlZmEzODliMTY0NDVmOWU0YzQ4M2MzNGYwODJhY2FjMDEwNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea","sha":"48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea"}],"sha":"d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/d96eefa389b16445f9e4c483c34f082acac01069"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:49:21Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:49:21Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"La maquette n''était vérifiée par aucun typecheck\n\nSept cents lignes de TypeScript compilées sans qu''aucun compilateur ne les regarde :\nla configuration racine ne couvre que src/, et Vite transpile sans contrôler. Le\ndéfaut était invisible parce que tout fonctionnait — jusqu''au jour où quelque chose\nn''aurait plus fonctionné, à l''exécution, devant une salle.\n\nEn activant la vérification, deux erreurs réelles sont apparues immédiatement :\n\n  - mf-filtres redéclarait localement la forme du verdict rendu par le socle, avec des\n    tableaux mutables là où le socle rend des lectures seules. Deux descriptions du\n    même contrat, libres de diverger. Le fragment importe désormais le type.\n  - la glu wasm n''était pas déclarable telle que je l''avais écrite : TypeScript résout\n    « ./calcul.js » vers le fichier de déclaration voisin, qui doit exporter\n    directement au lieu d''envelopper dans un « declare module ».\n\nAjoute donc :\n  - types/socle-bus.d.ts, qui type l''API du socle. Les CHARGES UTILES restent unknown,\n    délibérément : leur forme n''est vérifiée que par le validateur, à l''exécution.\n    Les typer ici reviendrait à supposer résolu le problème que l''étude démontre.\n  - equipe-calcul/src/calcul.d.ts, qui redit à la main ce que wasm-bindgen génère.\n    Cette duplication a un coût réel et il est écrit dans le fichier : une frontière\n    entre deux langages décrite par un contrat que rien ne confronte aux deux côtés.\n  - un tsconfig de maquette en mode strict, avec noUncheckedIndexedAccess.\n\n« npm run typecheck » et la recette couvrent maintenant les deux moitiés du dépôt.","tree":{"sha":"bfabdc79928ec07701b20ccdd6f53e05a841f423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/bfabdc79928ec07701b20ccdd6f53e05a841f423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKDQ4Yjc1YjZiYjkxOTJhYWZkN2QwZGY2YzQ1YjNkMzlkYzc5YzNjZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a","sha":"a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a"}],"sha":"48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/48b75b6bb9192aafd7d0df6c45b3d39dc79c3cea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:44:14Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:44:14Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Le dépôt concurrent : désabonnement, et une URL qui avait cessé d''exister\n\nDeux corrections, dont une régression que j''avais introduite sans m''en apercevoir.\n\nLe fragment du dépôt concurrent s''abonnait sans jamais se désabonner, et attachait son\nShadow DOM dans connectedCallback — ce qui lève si l''élément est retiré puis réinséré.\nIl ne monte jamais dans cette maquette, puisque `define` lève avant lui sur un nom déjà\npris. Il est néanmoins écrit correctement maintenant : un fragment de démonstration qui\nmontre un mauvais exemple est un mauvais fragment de démonstration.\n\nLa régression, plus sérieuse. Le shell chargeait ce dépôt depuis une URL codée en dur,\nsans version. Le jour où les serveurs sont passés de dist à publie, cette URL a cessé\nd''exister : le bouton rendait un 404 au lieu de démontrer le conflit de nom de balise.\nL''essai avait l''air de tourner — il produisait bien une erreur — mais ce n''était plus\nla bonne.\n\nLe dépôt concurrent a donc désormais son entrée versionnée dans le manifeste, avec son\nempreinte, comme tous les autres artefacts. Le shell l''y lit.\n\nEt la recette vérifie maintenant cette entrée : elle ne couvrait que les fragments\nmontés, ce qui est précisément pourquoi elle n''a rien vu.","tree":{"sha":"8e1985efee6766fa8ff0fee4699ec37f47502887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/8e1985efee6766fa8ff0fee4699ec37f47502887"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKGE3OGIzMzVlZTNiMDZlYTc2YWEwNWQ3YmViZDg1NGRjMTQ1NjE4OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95","sha":"d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95"}],"sha":"a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/a78b335ee3b06ea76aa05d7bebd854dc1456189a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:39:57Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:39:57Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"La page de coexistence ne portait plus un seul enseignement\n\nElle servait le socle 2.0 à mf-filtres, alors que ce fragment avait migré sur l''API 3.0\nqui rend un verdict au lieu d''un entier. Le fragment lisait `.remis` sur un nombre,\nobtenait `undefined`, et affichait « aucun abonné ne l''écoutait ». C''était vrai par\naccident : avec un abonné, il aurait affiché la même chose, et faux.\n\nCette page a une seule chose à démontrer — deux URL font deux instances, donc deux\nétats, même quand le code est identique. Un décalage d''API par-dessus rendait le\nsilence attribuable à la mauvaise cause.\n\nCorrigé par un socle 4.0 dont l''API est strictement identique à la 3.0 : seuls le\nnuméro, donc l''URL, donc l''instance changent. Les socles 1.0 et 2.0, plus référencés\nnulle part, sont supprimés.\n\nAligne aussi le libellé du fragment calcul, qui affichait « wasm 1.0.0 » — la version\nde la caisse Rust, distincte de celle du fragment. Les deux numéros sont désormais\nalignés et le libellé dit « module Rust ».\n\nAu passage, la porte d''immuabilité a fait son travail sur moi : elle a refusé de\nrepublier 1.1.0 avec un contenu différent, et exigé une version neuve.","tree":{"sha":"c825b3710d1b8e093597ae5cb8ccaaa4a8c04294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/c825b3710d1b8e093597ae5cb8ccaaa4a8c04294"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKGQwZWJhYzA1MmEyNGJhY2Q3MGI3NjY4ZDU2YTYxZjdlOWY5MjJmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c","sha":"7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c"}],"sha":"d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/d0ebac052a24bacd70b7668d56a61f7e9f922f95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:32:50Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:32:50Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Désabonnement au démontage, et une recette qui ne se ment pas sur les versions\n\nLes fragments de la maquette ne se désabonnaient pas quand ils quittaient le document.\nLeur gestionnaire restait dans le bus : il continuait de recevoir des messages, il\nretenait l''élément détaché et tout ce qu''il capturait, et publier() comptait un abonné\nqui n''affichait plus rien. Le producteur croyait être entendu alors qu''il parlait à un\nfantôme.\n\nRien dans le bus ne le fait à la place de l''abonné : abonner() rend une fonction de\ndésabonnement, et c''est à l''abonné de la garder et de l''appeler. La démonstration\nprincipale le faisait déjà ; la maquette non.\n\nVérifié à l''écran, chaîne complète :\n    2 abonnés : mf-tableau, mf-calcul\n      démonter mf-tableau  → 1 abonné : mf-calcul\n      démonter mf-calcul   → « charge conforme, mais aucun abonné ne l''écoutait »\n\nCe dernier libellé n''aurait pas été possible avant le socle 3.0, qui distingue une\ncharge refusée d''une charge que personne n''écoute.\n\nmf-filtres ne reçoit aucun correctif : il ne s''abonne à rien, il ne fait que publier.\nY ajouter un désabonnement aurait été du code mort.\n\nCorrige aussi la recette, qui vérifiait les artefacts wasm d''une version codée en dur.\nElle serait restée verte sur des fichiers que plus personne ne sert. Elle lit\nmaintenant la version réellement déployée dans le manifeste.","tree":{"sha":"37eeabe40204592f76205166b325f243af0ed73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/37eeabe40204592f76205166b325f243af0ed73a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKDc5OTVmMTIyMmVjM2ViY2M2YTUxNjE5ODNjODllZGYzZjBkN2FhN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9","sha":"1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9"}],"sha":"7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/7995f1222ec3ebcc6a5161983c89edf3f0d7aa7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:28:52Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:28:52Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Mesures rejouables, et une page qui refuse de mentir\n\nLes chiffres qui fondent cette étude n''existaient que dans des notes. Ils sont\nmaintenant reproductibles : shell/mesures.html les refait sur la machine et le\nnavigateur de qui les lit.\n\nCinq mesures, dans l''ordre où elles décident quelque chose : qui protège d''un fragment\nqui part en boucle, si terminate() interrompt du code non coopératif, ce que coûte un\nfranchissement par taille de charge, ce que coûte l''existence d''un Worker, et si la\ncarte d''import traverse la frontière du Worker.\n\nLa page REFUSE de mesurer quand l''environnement n''est pas fiable — onglet en\narrière-plan, ou fil principal déjà perturbé au repos. Chrome bride les minuteurs d''un\nonglet masqué à environ un par seconde : tous les blocages y rendent ~1000 ms,\nréférence comprise. Le premier jet produisait exactement ces chiffres, crédibles et\nfaux. Une mesure silencieuse et fausse coûte plus cher que pas de mesure.\n\nComplète aussi la recette sur les trois artefacts wasm de l''équipe calcul, qui sont\nindissociables : sans sa glu le binaire n''est pas chargeable, sans le binaire la glu\néchoue à l''initialisation.","tree":{"sha":"d9d291acddc85d53edca225164baeee1a402d344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/d9d291acddc85d53edca225164baeee1a402d344"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKDFkNzE0ZGQwOTMwMjY3ZDI1ZDY0NDAyMWJjN2I5M2Y3MTUxYjY3Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6","sha":"c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6"}],"sha":"1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/1d714dd0930267d25d644021bc7b93f7151b67b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:21:18Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:21:18Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Équipe calcul : la logique d''un fragment écrite en Rust, compilée en WebAssembly\n\nAjoute une cinquième équipe à la maquette. Elle démontre l''indépendance de langage\nau niveau du CALCUL, et mesure ce qu''elle coûte.\n\nLe fragment expose la même agrégation trois fois : en JavaScript sans franchir de\nfrontière, en Rust avec du JSON à l''aller et au retour, en Rust avec des tableaux\ntypés. Mesuré dans Chrome 151, sur 100 000 tâches :\n\n    JavaScript        2,34 ms\n    Rust / JSON      33,46 ms\n    Rust / colonnes   0,240 ms\n\nUn facteur 140 entre deux appels au même code Rust, selon la seule forme des données\nqu''on fait traverser la frontière. L''approche naïve est plus lente que de ne pas\nfranchir la frontière du tout. C''est la thèse du dépôt, transposée d''un cran : le prix\nd''une frontière ne tient pas au langage, il tient à ce qu''on lui fait traverser.\n\nCoût d''entrée mesuré : 37,4 ko gzip — binaire wasm 32,3, glu wasm-bindgen 2,6,\nfragment 2,5. Le « hello world » Rust en pesait 14,7 : serde et serde_json doublent\nla charge.\n\nCe que le fragment ne démontre pas, et qu''il affiche lui-même : WebAssembly n''a aucun\naccès au DOM. Il isole le calcul, jamais l''affichage.\n\nDétails d''intégration :\n  - les trois fichiers (fragment, glu, binaire) sont publiés et versionnés ensemble ;\n  - la glu est externe au bundle, sans quoi Vite inline le wasm en base64 — mesuré\n    102 ko au lieu de 14 ;\n  - construire.mjs transmet ~/.cargo/bin au sous-processus, faute de quoi wasm-pack\n    échoue sur un « cargo introuvable » opaque ;\n  - target/ et pkg/ sont exclus, mais les artefacts PUBLIÉS sont versionnés : un clone\n    sans Rust fait tourner la maquette.","tree":{"sha":"1ee72202ee7c3f6e279d6c80b72fd8b7cf9379a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/1ee72202ee7c3f6e279d6c80b72fd8b7cf9379a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKGMyNzQxMjc1YmIxNTgzMzdkM2ZhOGMyMmNkNzMwN2MyNTE2NTlmZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc","sha":"9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc"}],"sha":"c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/c2741275bb158337d3fa8c22cd7307c251659ff6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:01:30Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:01:30Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Déploiement indépendant : versions immuables, contrats vérifiés, pannes qualifiées\n\nComplète la maquette d''indépendance sur les quatre mécanismes qui manquaient pour\npasser de la recompilation séparée au déploiement indépendant. Chacun a été construit\nparce qu''aucun n''est fourni par la plateforme — et c''est le propos.\n\nPublication et déploiement séparés\n    publier.mjs   artefacts sous publie/<version>/, immuables ; republier une version\n                  avec un contenu différent est refusé ; empreintes SHA-384 reportées\n                  dans la clé integrity de la carte d''import, donc opposables\n    basculer.mjs  déployer et revenir en arrière sans recompiler ni redémarrer\n\nPorte de déploiement sur combinaisons\n    combinaisons.mjs, approuver.mjs — une combinaison de versions jamais assemblée est\n    refusée. Le shell teste réellement l''assemblage dans le navigateur et poste son\n    verdict : la porte enregistre une preuve, plus une déclaration humaine. Le piège\n    de la coexistence de versions est ainsi attrapé avant déploiement.\n\nContrats vérifiés à la frontière\n    socle/v3 — publier() rend un verdict explicite au lieu d''un entier ambigu, et\n    valide la charge utile avant remise : forme, ensembles de valeurs, bornes, règles\n    inter-champs, fenêtre de migration multi-versions. Le schéma vit dans le socle,\n    pas chez le producteur, sans quoi la vérification ne vaudrait rien.\n\nPannes qualifiées\n    Le navigateur rend le même TypeError pour un refus CORS, un 404 et une empreinte\n    incorrecte. Le shell refait une requête et tranche.\n\nRupture assumée du socle en 3.0 : seules les équipes exploitant la valeur de retour\nont dû être reconstruites — mf-tableau 1.0.0 tourne sans modification.\n\noutils/recette.mjs vérifie l''ensemble en trois secondes. DEROULE.md enchaîne les deux\nartefacts en douze minutes ; le README principal porte le cadrage corrigé.","tree":{"sha":"fdd1659b2c622ac95ca9639ed615c61a754c814f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/fdd1659b2c622ac95ca9639ed615c61a754c814f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKDk3MzRmMTEzNGE2ZGNjMzFkNTY0ZTllMzY0MzY2Y2VlZTkzMTlkZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c","sha":"2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c"}],"sha":"9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/9734f1134a6dcc31d564e9e364366ceee9319dfc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:04:38Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:04:38Z","email":"arnaudherman.ah@gmail.com","name":"arnaudherman"},"message":"Démonstration : ce que coûte une frontière de service déplacée dans le navigateur\n\nDeux applications web autonomes, sans back-end, sans requête réseau sortante,\npour une étude d''architecture sur la modularité des interfaces côté client.\n\nsrc/\n    « La frontière » — quatre micro-frontends montés indépendamment au-dessus\n    d''un cluster Kubernetes fidèlement simulé par @ngrok/webernetes, séparés\n    par une frontière visible à l''écran. Six essais mesurent ce que le réseau\n    qualifie et que le bus d''événements laisse passer en silence.\n\nmaquette-independance/\n    Résolution à l''exécution par carte d''import — trois dépôts, trois chaînes\n    de construction, six origines. Démontre la recompilation séparée, et que\n    la coexistence de deux versions d''une dépendance partagée casse le partage\n    d''état sans lever la moindre exception.\n\nInvariants vérifiés mécaniquement, pas commentés :\n  - aucun module de src/haut n''importe src/bas, et réciproquement\n  - aucun fragment n''importe le code d''un autre fragment\n  - le spécificateur nu @socle/bus survit à la compilation des artefacts\n  - aucun artefact n''embarque de copie du socle partagé\n\nREADME.md porte le déroulé de huit minutes, DEROULE.md celui de douze qui\nenchaîne les deux artefacts. « npm run recette » lance les 17 vérifications.","tree":{"sha":"e0f3ad5293b8459766d0c3b53443f249fe5594ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/trees/e0f3ad5293b8459766d0c3b53443f249fe5594ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/git/commits/2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95316783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman","id":95316783,"login":"arnaudherman","node_id":"U_kgDOBa5rLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arnaudherman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commit/2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c","node_id":"C_kwDOT1Y_3NoAKDJhMzE4YWMxMjFkZWMwNzJmOWQzOWJlYmVmNDE5Nzk4ZmNmNjJhMGM","parents":[],"sha":"2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits/2a318ac121dec072f9d39bebef419798fcf62a0c"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/arnaudherman/webernetes-microfrontend-idk/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=3a252b0d511462e166b37bdcc47c1a89b50bad48&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A43%3A50.469Z"}');
