{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41765025?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kampouse","id":41765025,"login":"Kampouse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzY1MDI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kampouse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/9a1397232b829fa718e3b5530bf0133339d15692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T17:43:44Z","email":"41765025+Kampouse@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jean-philippe Martel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T17:43:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: remove DB-backed bindings, repoint hasBinding to KV (#8)\n\nRemoves the legacy database layer now that nearbuilders.org UI has\n\nfully migrated to the /v1/* routes.\n\nRemoved:\n\n- BindingsService (services/bindings.ts) — DB-backed binding CRUD\n\n- db/ directory — drizzle schema, migrations, migrator, layer, driver\n\n- drizzle.config.ts, vitest.config.ts\n\n- near-nostr/ — legacy service used only by deleted routes\n\n- NOSTR_DATABASE_URL secret\n\n- drizzle-orm, pg, @electric-sql/pglite, @types/pg, drizzle-kit,\n\n  @proj-airi/unplugin-drizzle-orm-migrations, vitest from deps\n\n- Deprecated routes: getIdentity, publishComment, listComments,\n\n  createBinding, deleteBinding, getBinding, getProfile\n\n- Legacy schemas: NearNostrTargetSchema, NostrEventSchema,\n\n  NearNostrCommentSchema, NearNostrIdentitySchema, NostrBindingSchema,\n\n  NostrProfileSchema\n\nChanged:\n\n- getPublicKey.hasBinding now reads FastNear KV (via BindingService)\n\n  instead of the DB-backed BindingsService\n\n- listRelays reads core.relays instead of nearNostr.config.relays\n\nExisting DB rows are treated as unverified (no proof-of-ownership);\n\nusers re-bind via the challenge/verify wallet-tx flow.\n\nPer @elliotBraem on #6 — no dual-write, no DB fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jean-Philippe Martel <jean@Jean-Philippes-Mac-mini-2.local>","tree":{"sha":"0b4161cacf6e7aa92ef91286e346b3add322fc29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/0b4161cacf6e7aa92ef91286e346b3add322fc29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/9a1397232b829fa718e3b5530bf0133339d15692","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b4161cacf6e7aa92ef91286e346b3add322fc29\nparent cc13bb5f8b66f4963234447f0671691c18192cca\nauthor Jean-philippe Martel <41765025+Kampouse@users.noreply.github.com> 1788284624 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788284624 -0500\n\nchore: remove DB-backed bindings, repoint hasBinding to KV (#8)\n\nRemoves the legacy database layer now that nearbuilders.org UI has\n\nfully migrated to the /v1/* routes.\n\nRemoved:\n\n- BindingsService (services/bindings.ts) — DB-backed binding CRUD\n\n- db/ directory — drizzle schema, migrations, migrator, layer, driver\n\n- drizzle.config.ts, vitest.config.ts\n\n- near-nostr/ — legacy service used only by deleted routes\n\n- NOSTR_DATABASE_URL secret\n\n- drizzle-orm, pg, @electric-sql/pglite, @types/pg, drizzle-kit,\n\n  @proj-airi/unplugin-drizzle-orm-migrations, vitest from deps\n\n- Deprecated routes: getIdentity, publishComment, listComments,\n\n  createBinding, deleteBinding, getBinding, getProfile\n\n- Legacy schemas: NearNostrTargetSchema, NostrEventSchema,\n\n  NearNostrCommentSchema, NearNostrIdentitySchema, NostrBindingSchema,\n\n  NostrProfileSchema\n\nChanged:\n\n- getPublicKey.hasBinding now reads FastNear KV (via BindingService)\n\n  instead of the DB-backed BindingsService\n\n- listRelays reads core.relays instead of nearNostr.config.relays\n\nExisting DB rows are treated as unverified (no proof-of-ownership);\n\nusers re-bind via the challenge/verify wallet-tx flow.\n\nPer @elliotBraem on #6 — no dual-write, no DB fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jean-Philippe Martel <jean@Jean-Philippes-Mac-mini-2.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlw7QCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARjMQAHWlcjhiY+sHpEc5+gBvPiWP\nHVsoKYbj0cbYVfbLZHWlCehKo36d88EgZKdP8VRnbGA/sFRXm5PakAZdZwZEVIt0\n+VzC8G2g7UOPpaPsWEF9ENUPzqD2Ejvecrzn2H0ZXWIcykxfvUHMD8EOeEWZZpZg\ngWsRflbzQ1+bchhGCZCUGcm1R/B3qwI5FIx+4ClYuxqpeqdpmQ+JxlzmYTmyDa+Q\nv2tLHcC8TDJtkcR4mAo/G6LTC6n5aUYWqTxvxfyl5zpAZ6iqYCyhv7+2VausvL0W\nUNEf6T0gUB5lK85USubCb0EIHlYISdgPjt2z5SQ1p4yUMbPb1DqrJ3/9sdO2xYJm\nA/HNUyWxaFDCY+eMtbIRc+7vkXb0iykyvTTC6+z6FkJMhVPdXaCD7JZV6Zzp/RmN\n1JaJsY7opuj8hmUjP8VvS1odmp/JPQAI5r3sf6Li6Yg9lEiIlcD7G5xfc7eMcrxF\ni3OOTVNHPmt4+ut5mvAbATZzssWV7DeYHQXAFdER8F64ZvVvjXfMfXYW86yp8Gb6\nE+LLJr2fqfSGQMVpBYj7WVIFs4+zYjeOUUI1Q5owsIkLOpt3hvJCuEd8CIsvZ5K9\n6HdcYLd+DdftNn1Anjg+m8OYpfzfnLiYRabXBb2Xf/w0Ow9ATBoEgBnx6coUnFTO\nr+SZUIsX5ulWS+O4Yi2z\n=cDFG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T17:43:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3