{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T02:06:10Z","email":"jean-philippe@kampouse.near","name":"Jean-Philippe Martel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T02:06:10Z","email":"jean-philippe@kampouse.near","name":"Jean-Philippe Martel"},"message":"fix: comments as NIP-22 kind 1111 instead of kind 1\n\nKind 1 comments pollute the global nostr feed (every project comment\nappears as a plain note in Damus/Primal, context-free). Comments belong\nin the dedicated NIP-22 comment kind 1111:\n\n- publish: kind 1111 (threading tags unchanged — e/root markers already set)\n- read: kinds [1111, 1] — legacy kind-1 comments keep rendering during\n  migration; drop the kind-1 read once nothing depends on it\n- contract default kind 1 → 1111","tree":{"sha":"e1e5fcb738c19c04a3e7efed64cfe46b3d3fe61d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/e1e5fcb738c19c04a3e7efed64cfe46b3d3fe61d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/233a8cd56459d8bd91df5c1687beef5b2d5456c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commit/233a8cd56459d8bd91df5c1687beef5b2d5456c2","node_id":"C_kwDOT1kFAdoAKDIzM2E4Y2Q1NjQ1OWQ4YmQ5MWRmNWMxNjg3YmVlZjViMmQ1NDU2YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commit/6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa","sha":"6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa"}],"sha":"233a8cd56459d8bd91df5c1687beef5b2d5456c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/233a8cd56459d8bd91df5c1687beef5b2d5456c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:38:27Z","email":"jean-philippe@kampouse.near","name":"Jean-Philippe Martel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:38:27Z","email":"jean-philippe@kampouse.near","name":"Jean-Philippe Martel"},"message":"nostr plugin parity: KV bindings (challenge/verify) + comments adapters from nearbuilders.org #162\n\nAdds the nearbuilders.org nostr-bindings and nostr-comments routes as a\nsuperset alongside the existing DB-backed routes, so both plugins can be\nremote-loaded from here:\n\n- BindingService (FastNear KV reads, profile enrichment, challenge/verify,\n  prepare KV write for client-side wallet tx) from plugins/nostr-bindings\n- NostrCommentService (standard/buzz relay adapters, raw query/publish,\n  profile lookup) from plugins/nostr-comments, adapted to the local\n  nostr-core adapters instead of near-nostr-sdk\n\nNew routes (paths + zod shapes identical to the nearbuilders.org contracts):\n  GET  /v1/binding/{nearAccountId}    GET  /v1/identity/{nearAccountId}\n  POST /v1/binding/challenge          POST /v1/binding/verify\n  POST /v1/binding/prepare            GET  /v1/comments\n  POST /v1/comments                   GET  /v1/buzz/channels\n  POST /v1/nostr/query                POST /v1/nostr/publish\n  GET  /v1/nostr/profile/{pubkey}\n\nNew variables: STANDARD_RELAYS, BUZZ_RELAYS, BUZZ_NSEC, KV_API_URL,\nBINDING_CONTRACT, CHALLENGE_EXPIRY_SECONDS.\n\nLegacy DB-backed routes stay functional and are marked DEPRECATED with\ntheir successors; they can be removed once UIs migrate.\n\nNote: upstream nostr-comments referenced an undeclared KV_API in its\nrequireVerified path; declared here so the verified filter actually works.\n\nRef: NEARBuilders/nearbuilders.org#162","tree":{"sha":"4fce650e5cea5fc2eb42e7256c0281554c58b806","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/git/trees/4fce650e5cea5fc2eb42e7256c0281554c58b806"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/git/commits/6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commit/6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa","node_id":"C_kwDOT1kFAdoAKDZlODE5MmU5YWQ5OWJkMTMzMzBiNzIwYmJjOTMxZWQxNWE3YTBjYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commit/bbd6b2ed076c97d5827019cb89b7196b3fd713a3","sha":"bbd6b2ed076c97d5827019cb89b7196b3fd713a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/bbd6b2ed076c97d5827019cb89b7196b3fd713a3"}],"sha":"6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/6e8192e9ad99bd13330b720bbc931ed15a7a0caa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/nostr.nearbuilders.org/commits/bbd6b2ed076c97d5827019cb89b7196b3fd713a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026