t":{"login":"sirine5214","providerType":"User"},"email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-11T21:14:49Z","committedDate":"2026-08-11T21:14:49Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"sirine5214","providerType":"User"},"email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:10:00.438Z","repositoryId":1331356673,"sha":"7e982247e879342e24d46bfb9cdbb4a0a4bf3a6b"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:10:00.438Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/596b6fc1ebc0521f3df11c603cc65bbda8567de2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:44:23Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:44:23Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"CI: reparer la condition de branche qui sautait le push et le deploiement k8s\n\n« when { branch ''main'' } » ne lit que BRANCH_NAME, variable posee uniquement par un job\nMultibranch Pipeline. Ce job est un Pipeline simple « script from SCM » : la condition\ncomparait donc toujours une valeur nulle et les etapes Docker: Push Images et\nDeploy: Kubernetes etaient sautees a chaque build, quelle que soit la branche\n(« skipped due to when conditional » au build 13). La branche est desormais resolue dans\nl''etape Checkout — BRANCH_NAME, sinon GIT_BRANCH sans son prefixe origin/, sinon le nom lu\ndans le depot — et exposee en EST_MAIN.\n\nLe deploiement n''applique plus le repertoire k8s/ entier mais chaque manifeste nommement.\nLe repertoire contient secret.example.yaml, gabarit aux valeurs « change-me », tandis que le\nvrai secret.yaml est dans .gitignore donc absent du workspace de l''agent : l''apply global\naurait ecrase POSTGRES_PASSWORD et JWT_SECRET par celles du gabarit. Le secret stb-secrets\nse cree une fois, a la main, sur le cluster.","tree":{"sha":"d8d5b641087186b720172af0e74aa2e5812e2f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/d8d5b641087186b720172af0e74aa2e5812e2f3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/596b6fc1ebc0521f3df11c603cc65bbda8567de2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/596b6fc1ebc0521f3df11c603cc65bbda8567de2","node_id":"C_kwDOT1rkAdoAKDU5NmI2ZmMxZWJjMDUyMWYzZGYxMWM2MDNjYzY1YmJkYTg1NjdkZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055","sha":"9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055"}],"sha":"596b6fc1ebc0521f3df11c603cc65bbda8567de2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/596b6fc1ebc0521f3df11c603cc65bbda8567de2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:17:28Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:17:28Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"CI: construire les images a partir des artefacts du pipeline au lieu de rebatir les sources\n\nL''etape « Docker: Build Images » refaisait dans un conteneur le travail que le pipeline\nvenait de terminer. Le jar est produit par « Backend: Build & Unit Tests » en 1 min 30\navec le depot Maven chaud de l''agent ; docker build repartait d''un depot vide et\nretelechargeait l''arbre de dependances complet, y compris des artefacts de reporting\n(doxia, velocity, commons-digester) dont le package n''a aucun besoin a cause de\ndependency:go-offline. Sur un lien lent (certains artefacts a 160 B/s) l''etape a depasse\n31 minutes, Jenkins a perdu le heartbeat du wrapper durable-task (JENKINS-48300) et le\nbuild est tombe sur « script returned exit code -1 ».\n\nDockerfile.ci, cote backend comme cote frontend, se contente d''empaqueter target/*.jar et\ndist/ deja construits : etage d''execution identique, image identique, quelques secondes au\nlieu de dizaines de minutes. Les Dockerfile multi-etapes restent en place pour\n« docker compose up --build » sur un poste ou rien n''a ete construit au prealable.\n\n.dockerignore ajuste en consequence : le jar et dist/ entrent dans le contexte, le reste de\ntarget/ et node_modules/ en restent exclus.\n\nTimeout de 15 minutes sur l''etape : un blocage reseau la fait echouer au lieu de laisser le\nbuild tourner sans fin.","tree":{"sha":"fccc618aeac00be554b845bc0b170cf7c908ec28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/fccc618aeac00be554b845bc0b170cf7c908ec28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055","node_id":"C_kwDOT1rkAdoAKDllYjA1YjNiNmNmNjVkZGYwMzM0OWNhNDI1ZDNmNjA2N2Q4MDcwNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/525b047c3382c5af2508a95bf182506f837dc421","sha":"525b047c3382c5af2508a95bf182506f837dc421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/525b047c3382c5af2508a95bf182506f837dc421"}],"sha":"9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/9eb05b3b6cf65ddf03349ca425d3f6067d807055"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/525b047c3382c5af2508a95bf182506f837dc421/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:10:42Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:10:42Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"Boite de reception des emails, supervision Grafana et nettoyage du template React\n\nBack_office : ingestion des e-mails de la boite partagee (entites EmailEntrant /\nPieceJointeEmail, repositories, DTO, controller REST /api/emails, service de triage\net de prequalification par mots-cles, scheduler de releve). Client \"fake\" en memoire\npar defaut pour que l''application et la CI demarrent sans compte de messagerie ; les\nidentifiants IMAP viennent de l''environnement, jamais du fichier de properties.\nAucune conversion automatique : un e-mail reste NON_TRAITE jusqu''a qualification\nhumaine, l''en-tete From n''etant pas authentifie.\n\nserver.port passe a ${SERVER_PORT:8082} : 8082 sur le poste de developpement, 8080\nen conteneur, comme l''attendent docker-compose, le HEALTHCHECK et Prometheus.\n\nSupervision : histogrammes de percentiles Micrometer + bornes de SLO explicites,\nnouveau dashboard Grafana front-office et refonte du dashboard back-office.\n\nFront_office : module Angular \"boite de reception\" + service email, entree de\nnavigation pour les roles administrateur et chef de projet, et suppression du\ntemplate React inutilise (Front_office/template_STB/react).\n\nTests et documentation : test fonctionnel de bout en bout (devops/tests), scenario\nde demonstration (docs/) et README mis a jour (boite de reception, test fonctionnel,\nvariables MAIL_* et SERVER_PORT, dashboards).","tree":{"sha":"848706442b39cc03cdae206f0749c33c9b6dddac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/848706442b39cc03cdae206f0749c33c9b6dddac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/525b047c3382c5af2508a95bf182506f837dc421","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type"