:25:16Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"Fix analyse SonarQube backend: coordonnees completes du plugin + couverture Jacoco\n\n- Jenkinsfile: ''sonar:sonar'' echouait (''No plugin found for prefix sonar'',\n  org.sonarsource.scanner.maven n''est pas dans les groupes de plugins connus\n  de Maven) -> coordonnees completes org.sonarsource.scanner.maven:sonar-maven-plugin:sonar.\n- pom.xml: argLine du surefire-plugin ecrasait celui injecte par\n  jacoco:prepare-agent (au lieu de le completer), donc aucune couverture\n  n''etait jamais enregistree - @{argLine} reprend la valeur de jacoco avant\n  d''ajouter le javaagent Mockito.","tree":{"sha":"34c878217a4f59e3e2e01df1c477e2573dc483ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/34c878217a4f59e3e2e01df1c477e2573dc483ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/ed3c0adee6cb49fbcb11bc4a97705d9f20eb4d24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","ur