ne5214"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:21:43Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"Back_office: application-test.properties + @ActiveProfiles au lieu de application.properties\n\nUn application.properties dans src/test/resources ecrase entierement celui\nde src/main/resources sur le classpath de test (meme nom = shadowing, pas\nfusion) : jwt.secret et le reste des proprietes principales disparaissaient,\nfaisant echouer le chargement du contexte (PlaceholderResolutionException).\napplication-test.properties + @ActiveProfiles(\"test\") se superpose\ncorrectement par-dessus le fichier principal.","tree":{"sha":"16da58a3de01e7f053126738ff1ae1e75ac43894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/16da58a3de01e7f053126738ff1ae1e75ac43894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/28540bef0d1a9a05f833f0224e84d5e37cf60baf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a