ment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:13:02Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"Back_office: abandonne Testcontainers, connexion JDBC directe au Postgres de test\n\nTestcontainers/docker-java (testcontainers-bom 1.20.4) ne fonctionne pas sur\ncette instance : le Docker Engine (API 1.52) rejette systematiquement l''appel\nde bootstrap en API 1.32 que docker-java envoie, sans que DOCKER_API_VERSION\nn''ait d''effet. Retour a une config JDBC simple dans\nsrc/test/resources/application.properties, pointant vers un vrai Postgres\ndedie et toujours actif (jenkins-backend-test-db, ajoute au\ndocker-compose-jenkins.yml, reseau jenkins-network) - plus de dependance a\nDocker depuis le process de test.","tree":{"sha":"33671509961537631b6e979b48dd88069a482b29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/33671509961537631b6e979b48dd88069a482b29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/bb3658092d13c0246cc30eb20eeb21f01588b7f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_