r-compose.ci.yml\n(jamais utilise) mais un conteneur autonome jenkins-sonarqube sur le\nreseau jenkins-network partage avec Jenkins. http://sonarqube:9000\n(ma correction precedente) ne resolvait rien sur ce reseau.","tree":{"sha":"2eabd582d870e803f1d40aded97cd5a03e390348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/2eabd582d870e803f1d40aded97cd5a03e390348"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/670cd5663234f0a5c77cd9e0dafc10fa367d3120","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/670cd5663234f0a5c77cd9e0dafc10fa367d3120","node_id":"C_kwDOT1rkAdoAKDY3MGNkNTY2MzIzNGYwYTVjNzdjZDllMGRhZmMxMGZhMzY3ZDMxMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462","sha":"280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462"}],"sha":"670cd5663234f0a5c77cd9e0dafc10fa367d3120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/670cd5663234f0a5c77cd9e0dafc10fa367d3120"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:50:25Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:50:25Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"DevOps: corrige pipeline Jenkins/SonarQube/K8s + build frontend Docker\n\n- Jenkinsfile: SONAR_HOST_URL pointait vers un hostname inexistant\n  (jenkins-sonarqube) -> corrige en \"sonarqube\", le nom du service dans\n  devops/jenkins/docker-compose.ci.yml (sinon echec DNS silencieux des\n  etapes d''analyse SonarQube, masque par catchError/UNSTABLE).\n- k8s/backend.yaml, k8s/frontend.yaml: image sirine5214/... -> sirinebb/...\n  pour matcher DOCKERHUB_NAMESPACE du Jenkinsfile.\n- Front_office/.../package.json, package-lock.json, yarn.lock: ajoute\n  @emnapi/core, @emnapi/runtime, @emnapi/wasi-threads en\n  optionalDependencies explicites. Le lockfile committe ne les resolvait\n  pas (peerDependencies optionnelles de @napi-rs/wasm-runtime), ce qui\n  faisait echouer `npm ci` en environnement Linux/alpine (image Docker\n  node:22-alpine) meme si `npm install` passait sur Windows.\n- Back_office/pom.xml: declare mockito-core explicitement + maven-dependency-plugin\n  (proprietes-dependances) + argLine surefire -javaagent pour que\n  `./mvnw verify` (stage Jenkins \"Backend: Build & Unit Tests\") tourne\n  sans avertissement d''auto-attachement Mockito sur les JDK recents.\n- Notification.java: colonne \"type\" sans `default` dans columnDefinition\n  (Hibernate le reinjecte tel quel dans un ALTER COLUMN que Postgres refuse).\n- Ajoute la suite de tests unitaires backend (services + entities) consommee\n  par le stage de couverture Jacoco/SonarQube.\n- Corrections mineures Front_office/demandes + mise a jour README.","tree":{"sha":"dee2b252f85eea201a296032c53833804b7230a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/dee2b252f85eea201a296032c53833804b7230a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462","node_id":"C_kwDOT1rkAdoAKDI4MGM2OTBhZDU5M2Q2ZjE0MDZlN2MxMzNmMWI4YjQ2NGM5OTY0NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f","sha":"d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f"}],"sha":"280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/280c690ad593d6f1406e7c133f1b8b464c996462"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:50:31Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:50:31Z","email":"sirinebenchikh206@gmail.com","name":"sirine5214"},"message":"Ajout README + DevOps complet (Docker, Jenkins, SonarQube, Kubernetes, Grafana)\n\n- README.md : présentation, architecture (schéma mermaid), démarrage local/Docker,\n  comptes de démo, CI/CD, déploiement k8s, supervision.\n- Dockerisation : Dockerfile multi-stage pour Back_office (Maven -> JRE alpine) et\n  Front_office/angular (Node -> Nginx), avec proxy Nginx vers l''API (/api, /uploads, /ws)\n  pour fonctionner à la fois en Docker Compose et en Kubernetes sans URL codée en dur.\n- docker-compose.yml : stack applicative locale (postgres, backend, frontend, prometheus,\n  grafana) ; devops/jenkins/docker-compose.ci.yml : infra CI locale (Jenkins + SonarQube).\n- Jenkinsfile : pipeline déclaratif (build/tests -> analyse SonarQube -> quality gate ->\n  build/push images Docker -> déploiement Kubernetes sur main).\n- SonarQube : JaCoCo + plugin sonar-maven côté backend, sonar-project.properties côté\n  frontend Angular.\n- k8s/ : namespace, StatefulSet PostgreSQL, Deployments backend/frontend (probes,\n  ConfigMap, Secret, HPA), Ingress, ServiceMonitor Prometheus.\n- Supervision : Actuator + Micrometer Prometheus exposés côté backend\n  (/actuator/prometheus, autorisé sans JWT), dashboard Grafana provisionné\n  (débit HTTP, latence p95, erreurs 5xx, mémoire JVM, CPU, connexions HikariCP).","tree":{"sha":"ac75d24196f5f0c7da56d4a6b4f2cc5b0ff9c97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/trees/ac75d24196f5f0c7da56d4a6b4f2cc5b0ff9c97a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/git/commits/d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262999719?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214","id":262999719,"login":"sirine5214","node_id":"U_kgDOD60Opw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sirine5214","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f","node_id":"C_kwDOT1rkAdoAKGQxNmUxOTYxNGJlZmY2ZTk2OTExZTNlNmY4OWY2Mzg1MzQ5MzgzM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commit/7e982247e879342e24d46bfb9cdbb4a0a4bf3a6b","sha":"7e982247e879342e24d46bfb9cdbb4a0a4bf3a6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirine5214/Plateforme_Demande_interne_STB_BANK/commits/7e982247e879342e24d46bfb9cdbb4a0a4bf3a6b"}],"sha":"d16e19614beff6e96911e3e6f89f63853493833f","url":"https://api