3cb9f28f9d3266cd550dcf81992d6322ba7259\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1786844430 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1786844430 +0900\n\nスカイボックスをさらに暗くする\n\n#4a4e55 では壁より明るく浮いていたため #26282c にした。\n\n壁は meshLambertMaterial で、内側を向く面は環境光 0.15 しか当たらない。\n#6a6e76 でも実際の画面上は #25 前後まで沈むため、ライティングを受けない\nスカイボックスはその沈んだ値に合わせる必要がある。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPLWIrsneI44xNVOBRm3nmNn0hWiPXF1KqhJEcTSV7j6nQVrV58ks6jNSf6pjs4BOr\nLt8k7CUFPZRw0nIvT7xgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-16T01:40:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/commit/2a373a3a91b167843c52214f19acb2028a985cab","node_id":"C_kwDOT14E8NoAKDJhMzczYTNhOTFiMTY3ODQzYzUyMjE0ZjE5YWNiMjAyOGE5ODVjYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/commit/703cb9f28f9d3266cd550dcf81992d6322ba7259","sha":"703cb9f28f9d3266cd550dcf81992d6322ba7259","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/commits/703cb9f28f9d3266cd550dcf81992d6322ba7259"}],"sha":"2a373a3a91b167843c52214f19acb2028a985cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/commits/2a373a3a91b167843c52214f19acb2028a985cab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/commits/703cb9f28f9d3266cd550dcf81992d6322ba7259/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T01:36:20Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T01:36:20Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"message":"スカイボックスを壁・床と同系の単色にする\n\n背景写真（tokyo-station.jpg）が展示物より目立ってしまうため、\n壁や床と同じグレー系の単色で塗りつぶすようにした。\n暗色オーバーレイ用の二重球も不要になったので 1 枚にまとめた。\n\nスカイボックスは meshBasicMaterial でライティングを受けないため、\n壁と同じ hex にすると壁より明るく浮く。照明後の壁の見え方に寄せた\nCOLORS.sky を別に用意している。\n\n使わなくなった tokyo-station.jpg（884KB）も削除。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f1dc82034afdc93eb3e3fbe6c815da7625d1d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/git/trees/0f1dc82034afdc93eb3e3fbe6c815da7625d1d9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-world-item-lab/git/commits/703cb9f28f9d3266cd550dcf81992d6322ba7259","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f1dc82034afdc93eb3e3fbe6c815da7625d1d9c\nparent faedcb4d792219af25f3a2a5aba6b3a4eb20269f\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1786844180 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1786844180 +0900\n\nスカイボックスを壁・床と同系の単色にする\n\n背景写真（tokyo-station.jpg）が展示物より目立ってしまうため、\n壁や床と同じグレー系の単色で塗りつぶすようにした。\n暗色オーバーレイ用の二重球も不要になったので 1 枚にまとめた。\n\nスカイボックスは meshBasicMaterial でライティングを受けないため、\n壁と同じ hex にすると壁より明るく浮く。照明後の壁の見え方に寄せた\nCOLORS.sky を別に用意している。\n\n使わなくなった tokyo-station.jpg（884KB）も削除。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLNbamu3cDs/6oYrE7/Vm6Uus6BtUalgvMoK6MnaMAQy6tgw99PNW1Gl+llBD0NXjF\nzOrGPFZQLbJlUCn3AAcgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-16T01:36:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_